<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PRO" style="id">Thufim</book>
  <para style="h">Thufim</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thufim</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thufim</para>
  <para style="mt">Thufim</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David fapa, Israel siangpahrang, Solomon ih thufim tla:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fimnak, ruahnak ṭha le thudik simmi theih theinak na neih theinak dingah a lo bawm theitu ding thufim a um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih thufim cun umtlan thiamnak le dingnak, Fimkhur zet le tlaitluang zetih nun theinak a lo zirh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ruahnak mal pawl kha a fimter thei ih, Mino pawl kha theihthiamnak le ruahthiamnak a pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thufim in mifim pawl kha an fimnak a karhter ding ih, Mithiam pawl khal lam a hruai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah mifim pawl ih an suahpi mi thufim simfiangnak thukzet pawl le, Thu harsa pawl kha an thei suak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian ṭihzah cu fimnak ih hramthoknak a si, Mi aa pawl in fimnak le zirnak kha ziang an siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka fapa, na nu le na pa ih simmi thu kha ṭhatein ngai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An lo zirhmi thu in na nuncan ziaza a ṭhatter ding ih na lu hrangah lupawng mawizet le, na hngawng hrangah ṭhi mawi an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka fapa, misual pawl in an lo lemsiah tikah lung aw hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Annih in, “Ra awla mi pakhat tal that dingah hawl uhsi, Sualnak a nei lotu pawl kha bawh thup uhsi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mithi khua in mi a dolh bangin an nungcungin dolh uhsi, Sualnak an nei lo naón khur sungih a vung tla bangtuk si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thilri mankhung pawl kha kan lak ding ih, Kan inn pawl kha thilri mankhung thawn khatter uhsi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan hnenah ra tel ve awla, Kan firmi pawl kan lo zem ve ding,” tiah an lo ti tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka fapa, cuvek mi pawl hnenah feh aw hlah, An lamzin kha va hrial aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo tuah ding ahcun an zam a rang ih, Mi that dingah an ralring cia ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vate hmuh cingih suurthang kam cu zianghman a ṭhahnem lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain hivek mi ṭha lo pawl in anmah le anmah thang an kam aw ih, Cuih thangkammi sung ahcun an awk that aw leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Neh-lon ih mi thil a longtu pawl cun cubangtuk in thihnak an hawlh aw ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai hnik uh! Lamzinpi le thil zuarnak hmun ihsin fimnak au aw cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khawpi kotka le mi tonkhawmnak hmun ihsin napi in a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi aa pawl, ziangtik tiangso nan aat hrih ding? Ziangtik tiangso fimnak hmuhsuam hi nuam nan ti ding ih, Fimnak hi nan huat hrih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nun ka lo sim laiah ṭhatein ngai uh, Ruahnak ṭha ka lo pe ding ih, Ka fimnak kha ka lo seu ve ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hnenah ra dingin ka lo ko naón nan ra duh lo; Ka kut ka lo zaap ih nan ngaisaang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ruahnak ṭha ka lo pekmi pawl tla ziangsiar loin nan um ih, Nan nuncan ziaza remsak ding khal nan duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Curuangah harsatnak nan ton tikah ka lo hnihsan ding ih ṭihnung rapthlak in a lo tlunhnawh tikah ka hni thup ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Harsatnak cu thlisia bangin a ra thlen tik le, ṭihnungza in phusiing bangin a lo nuai tikah, Vansang le thinlung rethei in na um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutik ahcun in ko ding, Asinain ka lo sawn lo ding; Hmunkip ah in hawl ding naón in tong lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thutheihnak cu nan hua ih, Bawipa ṭihzah cu nan hril lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ruahnak ka lo pekmi pawl tla nan duh lo ih, Nun ka lo sim tikah nan ngai duh fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah nanmah ih ṭuanmi vekin nan ngah leh ding, Nan tuahmi pawl in natnak a lo pe ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ruahnak mal deuh pawl in fimnak an hnon ruangah an thi, Mi aa pawl cu an daithlannak in a siatsuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Asinain ka thu a ngaitu pawl cu an him ding ih, ṭihphannak zianghman an nei lo ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka fapa, ka lo simmi hi zir awla, Tuah dingih ka lo simmi kha na thinlung ah khum aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fimnak hi ziang a si ti kha ngai awla, Theithiam dingin na thinlung thawn zuam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A si, hmuhnak le theihnak kha na ko ih, Theihthiamnak khal na dil ahcun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngun bangin ngah na duh ih, Hlawnthil thuh mi bangin na hawl ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutin na tuah asile Bawipa ṭihzah cu ziang a si ti na thei ding ih, Pathian theihnak cu na hmu suak ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fimnak petu cu Bawipa a si ih, Amah ih hnen ihsin fimthiamnak le theihthiamnak an ngah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miding pawl le mi thinlung tluang pawl cu A bawm ih a humhim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Midang parah thuding a tuahtu pawl a humhim ih Amah a duhdawtu pawl kha a kilveng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thu na ngai a si ahcun a dikmi, a ṭha mi le Ka tuah ding mi ziang a si ti kha na thei thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Fimnak na lung sungah a lut ding ih, Na theihnak in a lo lungawi ter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na fimnak le na theih thiamnak khan a lo humhim ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo lakin a lo kham ding. Ṭong ṭha lo a hmangtu pawl lak ihsin a lo kilveng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cu pawl cun lamthim ih feh dingah lam dik cu an tlansan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo tuah kha an duhzawng a si ih, Thilsual tuahnak hmun ah an lung a awi ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rinsan tlak lo le zum tlak lomi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭongkam naal zet thawn a lo bumtu nunau ṭha lo hnen ihsin a lo run suak ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cu nu cu a pasal parah dingnak neilotu le, Pathian hnenih a thukam ziang a siarlotu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A inn ah na feh a si ahcun thihnak lamzin ah a fehtu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hnenah a fehtu cu zokhal an kirsal nawn lo. Nunnak lam an tong sal nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cu a si ruangah miṭha pawl ih lam cu na zawh dingih Miding pawl ih nun bangin na nung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miding mi le miṭha famkim pawl cu hi leilung ah an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu cuih ramsung ihsin Pathian in a dawihlo ding ih, Mi hrokhrawl pawl cu phawi hlo an si ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka fapa, ka lo zirh mi pawl tla kha hngilh hlah, Tuah dingih ka lo sim mi pawl kha ciing ringring aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lo zirh mi in nun saunak le nun nomnak a lo pe ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na hnen ihsin felnak le rintlak sinak khan ziangtik hmanah lo suahsan hlah seh; Na hngawng ah ngerh awla, na thin sungah ngan aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cubangtuk in na tuah asile Pathian hmai le minung hmaiah duhsaknak le hminṭhatnak na co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa cu na thinlung zate in rinsan aw. Nangmah ih ruahnak le theihnak kha rinsan aw hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tuah mi kipah Pathian cu thei ringring awla, Amah in lamzin dik a lo hmuh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka fim paam tiin ruat aw hlah; Bawipa cu ṭih awla, sualnak tansan aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cubangtuk in na tuah asile na taksa hrangah damnak a si ding ih, Na ruh hrangah sii ṭha a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa cu na sumsaw le na thlairah hmaisa bik in thangṭhat aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cubangtuk in na tuah asile na rawl inn cu rawlin a khat dingih, Na sabit ralca beel cu sabit thar in a liam thluahthlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka fapa, Bawipa ih nun simnak cu ziang rel loin va um hlah, A lo kawk tikah na thin na hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ziangahtile pa in a duhdawt zetmi a faate nun a sim bangin, Bawipa in a duhdawt mi pawl cu nun a sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fimnak a hmutu cu mi lungawi a si, Theihthiamnak a neitu khal a lung a awi ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fimnak cu ngun hnakin a ṭha sawn ih, Sui hnakin a man a khung sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Fimnak cu lungvar hnakin a man a khung deuh ih, Thil dang thawn tahṭhim theih a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fimnak in nun saunak le lennak le upatnak a lo pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lamzin cu nunkhua nomnak lamzin a si ih, A lamzin hmuahhmuah cu hnangamnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Fimnak neitu tla cu an lung a awi ih, Fimnak in nunnak a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa in leilungpi cu a fimnak thawn a sersiam ih, A theihthiam theinak thawn van cu a hngetter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A fimnak in tiva a luanter ih, Leilung ih ruah sur dingah mero a umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka fapa, na fimnak le na ruahthiamnak kha kai hnget aw, Na hnen ihsin ziangtik hmanah tlanter hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na thlarau hrangah nunnak a si dingih, Na hngawng hrangah mawinak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lamtluan ah himdamte in na feh thei ding ih, Rilhbahnak khal na tong dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zan na ih tikah na ṭih lo dingih, Ih hmuh thawte in zanvaar na ih that ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl hnenah thlisia bangin siatnak a thlen tikah, Zianghman donharnak na hrangah a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa in himdamte in a lo fingkhawi ding ih, Thang sungah a lo tlater dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ṭul a sammi pawl hnenah na tuah thei zat tiangin thil ṭha kha tuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na innhnen kha tu rori ah na bom thei mi asile thaizing tiang hngakter aw hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangmah rinsan in na kiangah a ummi na innhnen kha a tlun ah harsatnak tuah dingin tum aw hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na parah siatnak a tuah dah lotu va to rero hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi helhlong kha va daw hlah, Amah bangih tuah ding khal va ruat hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Zianghrangah tile, Bawipa in ṭhat lonak a tuahtu pawl cu a hua ih, Miding pawl cu a humhim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipa in mi sualral pawl ih inn kha a camsiat ih, Miding pawl ih inn cu thluasuahnak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Miziang siar lotu pawl cu ziangah a siar ve lo ih, Mi tangdortu pawl parah duhdawtnak a langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mifim pawl in upatnak le sunlawinak kha an ngah dingih, Mi aa pawl cu ningzahnak lawng an co ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka faale tla, nan pa ih a lo zirh mi pawl hi ṭhate in ngai uhla, Theihthiamnak nan neih theinak dingah cing ṭha uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lo zirh mi cu a ṭhat ruangah cingkeng ring ring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nu le ka pa ih fapa neihsun ka si ih, Ka sentet lai ihsin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pa in hiti in nun i sim, “Ka sim mi thu kha cingkeng ringring awla, Ziangtik hmanah hngilh hlah aw. Ka sim bangin tuah awla na nung ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Fimnak le theihfiangnak kha la awla, Ka simmi thu hi ziangsiar loin dungtun hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fimnak kha tlansan hlah awla a lo kilveng ding, Duhdawt awla himdamte in a lo humhim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Fimnak neih cu na tuah thei mi thil thupi bik a si, Na neihmi hmuahhmuah hman man sehla fimnak cu nei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Fimnak cu duh awla a lo khaisaang ding, Pomhnget awla upatnak a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah cu na lu parah a mawi mi pangpar rual a si ding ih, Na sunlawinak sui lukhuh a si ding.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka fapa, ka thu hi ngai aw, Ka sim mi hi thungai thlak in ruat awla na nunkhua a sau ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nundaan ṭha ka lo hmuh zo ih, Fimnak tla ka lo zirh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fimkhur zet ih na feh asile na lamtluan ah zianghman in a lo kham thei lo ding ih, Na tlan tik khal ah na bah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na zir mi pawl hi kaihnget awla, ṭhatein kilkhawi aw. Na nunnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih fehnak ah khan feh hlah aw; Mi siava pawl ih nunzia kha cawng hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuah hrimhrim hlah! Mi ṭha lo pawl hnenin tlan awla, Pialsan awla feh vivo aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Misual pawl cu thilsual ziangtal an tuah lo ahcun an itthat thei lo, Mi pakhatkhat tal an tuahmawh lo ahcun an ih a hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sualnak cu saang bangin an ei ih, Mi tuahmawhnak cu zu bangin an in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla miding pawl ih lamzin cu, Zing khawvang ihsin sun tiang a tleu sinsin mi tleunak bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl lamzin cu zanthim bangtuk a si, Ziang kan pal ih kan ril ti khal an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka fapa, ka lo sim mi thu hi ṭhatein ngai awla, Ka ṭongkam hi ṭhatein thlun aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na hnen ihsin ziangtik hmanah hloter hrimhrim hlah, Ciing ringring awla na lung sungah felte in ret aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A theithiamtu hmuahhmuah hrangah an nunnak a si ih, A hmutu hrangah an taksa harhdamnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ralringte in khua ruat aw, Ziangahtile na ruah mi in na nunnak a siamrem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A dik lomi thu zianghman rel hlah, ṭong hawizawng lo le thuphan va sim hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmailam dingtein zoh awla rinsan aw zet in feh aw; Na ningzak in leisin bih aw hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na tuah ding mi kha ṭhatein khuakhang cia awla, Cutin na tuah mi pawl cu felte in na tuah suak vivo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo kha hrial awla hmailam ah dingtein feh aw, Lamzin dik ihsin kal khat hman pial hlah aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka fapa, ka fimnak le ka theihnak kha ṭhatein ngai awla felte in ngaihtuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule ziangtin ziaza ṭha ka nei ding ti na thei suak dingih, Na ṭongkam in na thu theihnak kha a langter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nunau zuangzam hmurka cu khuaitizu bangin a thlum dingih, A ṭongkam cu olif siti bangin a naal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain a netnak ahcun a kha mi le harsatnak siarlo, A dang zianghman a tanta lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah in mithi khua ah a lo hnuk suk dingih, A zawh mi lamzin cu thihnak a thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nunnak lamzin ah um loin a vakvai ih, Ziang ka cang ti khal a thei aw lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka fapa, i rak ngai awla, Ziangtik hmanah ka simmi thu hi hngilh hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cubangtuk nunau cu hrial aw. A sangka kiang hmanah feh hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na hrial lo asile mi upatnak na neih cia mi kha An lo lawng dingih zaangfahnak a nei lotu pawl ih kutin, Na no laiah na thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi phundang pawl in na lennak kha an lo lawng dingih, Na ṭuan man kha midangpi in an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na thih zawng ah na hacang na rial dingih, Na tit le na sa cu a ṭumṭawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule, “Ziang ruangah so ka zirta lo? Ziang ruangah nun in sim mi ziang siar loin ka rak um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I zirhtu pawl ih thu ka ngai lo; I simtu pawl ziang hmanah ka siar fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah ruah lopi in midang hmaiah, Ningzahnak ka tuar a si,” tiah na ti leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na nupi parah rintlak in um awla, Amah pakhat lawng kha duhdawt aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Midang nunau thawn na neih mi faate tla in, Na parah ṭhatnak zianghman an tuah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na faate tla cu nangmah bawmtu dingah an ṭhang dingih, Mi phun dang cun an lo bawm lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah na no lai na nupi parah lungawi awla, A parah lungawi nomnak nei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun amah cu zukneng bangin a mawi mi le duhnungza a si. A duhnunnak cun a lo lungawiter dingih, A lo duhdawtnak in a lo zeel ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka fapa, ziang ruangah nunau dang na duh? Ziang ruangah midang nupi ih duhnunnak cu na duh sawn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in na tuah mi hmuahhmuah a hmu ṭheh, Na fehnak kipah a lo zoh vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi siava pawl ih sualnak tla cu thangkam mi vek a si, Anmah ih sualnak suur sungah an awk aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah le amah a fingkhawi awk thei lo ruangah a thi, A aat tuknak in amah ih thlankhur ah a thlenpi leh ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka fapa, midang ih lei an baak awknak ah, Kamawknak na nei dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmaió ṭongkam in a lo awk ih, Nangmaió kamawknak in a lo hreng maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuti asile ka fapa, cu pai kut sungah na um ih, Hiti lawng in na hlit aw thei ding. A hnenah zamrang in va feh awla suah va dil aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Itthat in cawl meen aw hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sakap pa ih kut sung ihsin vate le zukneng an tlan suak bangin Thang sung ihsin suah ding tum aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi zaangzel pawl cun sihte khi va zoh seh, Sihte nuncanzia zoh in zir seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Annih cu hruaitu upabik le lal le uktu an nei lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain ṭhal sungah rawl an khawl ih, Thlatang hrangah an ralring cia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi zaangzel pa cu ziangtik tiang so a ihthat hrih ding? Ziangtikah so a thawh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah cun, “Malte sung ka zauta pei, Caan malte sung kutsih in ka cawlta pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain a ihthat sungah farahnak a tong ding, Hriamnam thawn rukru in a thilri an lon mipa bangin, Tlasam in a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Santlai lo le mi siava pawl cu Thuphan per dingin an tawi vak ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mitsinhnak le mithmai hmuh awknak in an lo leemsiah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutiin an thinlung siava in ṭhat lonak khua an khang ih, Hmun kipah harsatnak an suahter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih ruangah an hnenah harsatnak kha rinlopi in a thleng dingih, Thihpi tlak in hriamhma an pu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa in a huat mi thil paruk a um, A fih mi thil pasarih a um. Puarthau mithmai, thuphan pertu lei, misual lo a thattu kut, sualralnak lawng khuakhangtu thinlung, thilsual tuah dingah a khul a rangtu ke, thuphan per tahrat in thu theihpitu sinak, unau pawl lakih harsatnak a suahpi ṭheutu pa, Hi pawl hi Bawipa ih fih mi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka fapa, na pa ih sim bangin tuah awla, Na nu ih zirh mi kha ziangtik hmanah hngilh hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An sim mi thu tla kha ciing ringring awla, Na thinlung sungah khum aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khual na tlawn tikah an lo zirhmi thu tla in a lo hruai dingih, Zan ah a lo kilkhawi dingih, sunah ruahnak a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An lo zirhnak cu a tleu ringring dingih, An nun simnak khan nundaanzia a lo zirh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nunau ṭha lo le mi nupi pawl ih leemsiahnak ihsin a lo humhim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na thinlung in an mawinak hahio hlah awla, An mitpar in lo kai hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi pakhat in hlawhhlangnu cu, saang hlom khat man thawn a saang thei, Asinain nu le pa sualnak cun a nunnak ih sumsaw hmuahhmuah A cemralter ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na puan kaang lotein na ṭaangah meisa na ret thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na ke kaang loin meiling parah na feh thei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cubangin midang nupi thawn ih tlang hi a ṭihnung zet mi a si ih, A ih pitu poh cu hremnak an tuar ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rilrawng ih rawl a firtu khi an nautat lemlo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asinain an kaih asile a let sarih in a ruul sal dingih, A neih hmuahhmuah in a pek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asinain midang nupi thawn a sualtu cu ruahnak nei lo mi aa a si. Amah le amah a siatsuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hremnak tuar in a hmin a sia ding; Kumkhua in ningzah a phur ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pasal in a nupi a zum nawn lo asile, Nasazet in a thiik ih a lehrulhnak cu a dai thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ziangvek sum le saw pek khalle a saang duh lo ih, Ziangvek luh lemnak khal in a thinlung a daiter thei lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka fapa, ka simmi hi ciing ringring awla, Tuah dingih ka lo sim hi hngilh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sim bangin tuah awla na nung ding, Ka lo zirhmi thu pawl kha na mitmu bangin kilkhawi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lo zirh mi hi ciingkeng ringring awla, Na thinlung sungah ngan aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Fimnak cu ka farnu ti awla, Theihfiangnak cu ka rualpi ṭhabik na si tiah ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi nupi le mi bum hmang ṭongkam thiam nunau ihsin a lo humhim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Voikhat cu ka inn tukvirh ihsin lenglam ka cuan ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawruah nei lo mi mino pawl lakah, A aa deuh mi tlangval pakhat khi ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah cu cuih nunau ṭha lo umnak lampi kel lam ahcun a feh. A inn kiang lam a hei pan rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zanlam khuathim hnuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule nunau ṭha lo nu in a ra hmuak, Cuih nunau nu cu hlawhhlang vekin a thuam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah cu ralṭha le ningzah nei lomi nunau a si, Inn hluum rep loin a vak ringring ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A caancaan ah lamkel kip le kotthler le thil zuarnak hmunin tlangval a bawh ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlangvalpa cu a rak pom ih a hnam, ningzak loin a zoh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuihsun ah raithawinak ka tuah ih, thawinak sa khal ka nei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah nangmah hawl dingin ka ra suak ih atu-ah ka lo tong ngah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ihkhun cu Izipt ram ih patzai puan mawi zet ka phah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka ihkhun cu mura, aloes le sinnamon rimhmui tla ka theh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ra awla, zanvaarte nomnak ah kan ciah aw pei, Pom aw in nuam tlang uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka pasal cu inn ah a um lo, Ram hlatpi ah khual a tlawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Paisa zaal khat in a keng ih, Thla thul hlan lo cu a ra tlung lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Duhnungza a ṭongkam thlumte thawn a leem ngah ih A mi lom thiamnak in a hruai hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cawcang in thahnak ding hmun a pan bangin le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Conkiang ih kah dingah zukneng in thang a pal bangin, Cuih nunau nu cu a thlun. Vate thang parih a fut bangin A nunnak tuksumza a si kha a thei lo
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah ka fapa le tla, ngaihnik uh. Ka lo sim mi thu hi ṭhatein ruat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuvek nunau ṭha lo lam kha nan thinlung pan ter hlah uh, A dung khal thlun hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amah ih ruangah mi tampi an siatral ih a thih ter zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A inn ah nan feh a si ahcun mithi khua lamzin a si ih, Thihnak khur sungih vungṭum bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngaihnik! Fimnak in a lo ko ih, Theihthiamnak cu a au rero a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lamzin kiang tlangzim parah le, Zinṭeek ah a ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawpi luhnak kotka kiang in a au ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Milai pawl, mi hmuahhmuah hnenah ka lo dil, Leitlun um mi hmuahhmuah ka lo ko a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ruahnak pitling hrihlo pawl, ruahnak pitling dingin zir uh. Mi aa pawl, ruahnak ṭha zir uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A sunglawi mi ka thu tla ngai uh, Ka simmi hi a dik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka simmi hi thutak a si. Thuphan cu ka huat zawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kaa ihsin a suakmi thu hmuahhmuah cu a dik, Mi hruai sualnak le thu dik lo a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Theithiamtu pawl hrang ahcun a fiang ṭheh ih, Fimnak hmutu pawl hrang ahcun a dik ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangka hnakin ruahnak ka lo pekmi hi hril sawn uh, Sui ṭhabik hnakin fimthiamnak khi hril sawn uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keimah cu fimnak ka si ih lungvar hnakin ka ṭha sawn, Na duhmi ziangdang thaw khalin na ṭhim thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keimah hi fimnak ka si ih, theihfiangnak khal ka nei. Theihnak le thu ṭhen theinak ka nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa ṭihzah cu sualnak huat khi a si. Hngalnak le puarthaunak, sualnak lamzin le a dik lo mi ṭongkam ka hua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khawkhan tumtah ciami ka nei ih ka ṭuansuak ṭheh, Theihtheinak ka nei ih ka cak fawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ram uknak ah siangpahrang pawl ka bawm ih, Uktu pawl uknak daan ṭha tuah dingin ka bawm a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leitlun ih ram uktu pawl, ramhrang hnaṭuantu pawl le, Uknak lam ih upa pawl tla cu keimahih bomnak thawn ram an uk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keimah i duhdawtu pawl ka duhdawt ih, I hawltu in in hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lennak le hminthannak ka nei ih, Mi neinung sinak le mi nehnak tla ka ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka hnen ihsin na ngah mi tla cu, A ṭhabik mi sui le ngun hnakin a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dingnak lampi ah ka feh ih, Lamzin dik kha ka thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I duhdawtu pawl hnenah lennak ka pek ih, An inn cu hlawnthil thawn ka khahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in hlanlaipi ih a tuah hmaisabik mi lakah, Keimah hi in sersiam hmaisabik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leilungpi seem hlanah keimah cu a hmaisabik ih tuah mi ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tipi thuanthum le tiva pawl an um hlanah ka suak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Fing le tlang pawl an um hlanah, Keimah cu ka suak zo ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leilung le ram pawl a hmaisabik sersiam mi, Leivut zatekhat hman Pathian in a tuah hlanah in tuah zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Van a seemsuah lai le tipi thuanthum kimvel a tuah lai ah khan ka um zo ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mero pawl tla van ih a hun ret laiah siseh, Tipi thuanthum ih tihna pawl a umter laiah khan siseh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tipi tla a suahnak hnak ih saangah a kai lonak dingih thu a pek laiah siseh, ka um. Leilungpi a hram a ṭoh lai khalah ka um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Inn ruangzingtu thil thiamzet bangin a kiangah ka um, Nitinte a lungawinak bik cu keimah ka si ih, A hmaiah ka lung a awi ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Leilungpi le a tlun um minung pawl parah, Ka lung a kim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka faale pawl, ka sim mi thu hi ngai uh. Ka simmi bangin tuah uhla nan lung a awi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka lo zirhmi kha ngai uhla fim zir uh, Hi thu cu ziangsiar loin um hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka thu a ngai ih nitinte ka sangka kiangah um in, Ka innsung luh a hngaktu cu an lung a awi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Keimah i hmutu cu nunnak a co dingih, A parah Bawipa a lung a awi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Keimah i tong lotu cu amai nunnak siatsuahtu a si ih, I huatu pohpoh cu thih a duh sawntu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Fimnak in a inn a sak zo ih a ṭhuam pasarih kha a phun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puai tuahnak hrangah ṭilva a that, A sabitti ah rimhmui a rawi ih cabuai khal a hung zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawsung hmun saangbik ihsin au dingah A hnen-um nunau pawl a thlah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ruahnak mal deuh pawl hmuahhmuah hitawk ah hin ra uh,” an ti. Mi aa deuh pawl hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ra uhla ka saang ra ei uh, Ka rawi cia mi sabitti ra in uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aatnak cu tanta uhla nung thlang uh, Fimnak lamzin kha thlun uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi puarthau pa nun na sim ahcun a lo hmuhsuam ding. Mi ṭha lo pa na mawhthluk ahcun hriamhma na tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi puarthau ziangtik hmanah nun va sim hlah, Nun na simnak ruangah a lo hua ding. Asinain mifim nun na sim ahcun a lo upat ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mifimpa nun sim aw, a fim sin ding; Midingpa thu sim aw, a thiamnak a tam sin ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian ṭih cu fimnak hramthoknak a si. A Thiang Mipa na theih ahcun theihthiamnak fimnak na nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Fimnak in na san a sauter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fimnak na neih ahcun ṭhathnemnak a lo pe ding, Fimnak na hnon ahcun harnak tuartu nangmah na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aatnak cu a kam a tam ih ruahnak zianghman a nei lo, Ningzah nei lo ṭongtam nunau vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A inn sangka ah a to, Asilole khuasung hmun saangbik ah a to ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maió hnaṭuannak thu ruat phah ih lamzin a feh mi pawl kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ruahnak nei lo mi pawl, hitawk lam ah ra uh,” a ti. Mi aa pa hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Firmi tidai cu a thlum deuh ih, Firmi saang cu a thaw deuh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A inn ih a fehtu pawl an thi ih, A innsung lut ngah zotu pawl cun, Mithi khua thukpi ah kan um ti kha an thei lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himi pawl hi Solomon ih thufim an si. Fapa fim in a pai lung a awiter; Fapa aa in a nui riah a siatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A dik loih na ngah mi in ṭhatnak a lo pe lo ding. Asinain dingnak in na nunnak a lo humhim thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in miṭha pawl rilrawng ih um ding a sianglo, Asinain miṭha lo pawl ih duhnak cu a hloh sak ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zaangzelnak in farahnak a suah ter, Lawtnak in lennak a suah ter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rawlkhawm cut caan ih a khawmtu pa cu mifim a si, Rawlkhawm caan ih ihthat cu ningzahnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miṭha pa in thluasuah a co ding, Miṭha lo pai ṭongkam in a ṭhatlonak nunzia a thup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miṭha pawl ciin ringring hi thluasuah a si, Asinain miṭha lo pawl ih hmin cu a ṭawtruai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mifim pawl in ruahnak ṭha pek mi an cosaang, Mi aa ṭongtam pawl cu siatralnak ah an thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Miding pawl cu an himdam ih hnangamte in an um, Asinain midinglo pawl cu mi in an thei ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thudik a thuptu cun harnak a suahter, Asinain langhngan in a kawktu cun daihnak a suahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miṭha pa ih ṭongkam cu nunnak cerhti a si, Asinain miṭha lo pa ih ṭongkam in ṭhat lonak nunzia a thup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huatnak in remlonak a suahter, Asinain duhdawtnak in sual palhnak hmuahhmuah a ngaithiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mifim cun sullam nei mi an ṭong, Asinain mi aa pawl cu hrem an ṭul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mifim in fimnak an khawlkhawm, Asinain mi aa pawl ih ṭongkam cu harsatnak thawn a hlat aw lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lennak in milian pawl a humhim, Farahnak in mifarah pawl a siatsuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭhatnak tuah man cu nunnak a si, Asinain sualnak cun sual sinsinnak lam ah mi a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nunsimnak a ngaitu pawl cu an nung ding, Asinain ka sual a ti duh lotu cu ṭihphannak sungah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huatnak thinlung thup a neitu cu thuphan per an si, Mi thangsiatnak a simtu cu mi aa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tamdeuh na ṭong le tamdeuh na sual ding, Mifim na si ahcun na ṭong suup aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miṭhapa ih ṭongkam cu ngun ṭhabik bangtuk a si, Miṭha lo pa ih ruahnak cu man a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miṭhapa ih ṭongkam in mi tampi a ṭhathnemter, Asinain na aatnak in nangmah le nangmah na that aw thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipaió thluasuahnak cu a lo liantertu a si, Hnaṭuan tamzet na ṭuannak in a lo lianter cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thilsual tuah hi a nuam a titu cu mi aa a si, Mifim pawl cu fimnak sungah lungawinak an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Miding pawl in an saduhthah mi an ngah, Asinain miṭha lo pawl cu an ṭih bik mi an tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thlisia a hran tikah miṭha lo pawl cu a hranhlo ding, Asinain miding pawl cu an him ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na hnaṭuantu dingah mi zaangzel lak hlah, Na lak asile na ha hrangih sabit thur bangtuk le, Na mit hrangih meikhu bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa cu upat aw, na nunkhua a sau ding, Miṭha lo pawl cu an san kim hlanah an thi ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Miṭha pawl ih ruahsannak in lungawinak a suahter. Miṭha lo pawl ih ruahsan mi cu thulolak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa in miding pawl a humhim, Asinain thil ṭha lo a tuahtu pawl cu a siatsuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Miding pawl cu himnak an nei camcin ding, Asinain miṭha lo pawl cu ram sungah umnak an nei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Miding pawl in fimnak thu kha an sim, Asinain miṭha lo pawl ih lei cu tan a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Miding pawl cun sim ding mawi an thei, Asinain miṭha lo pawl cun mi siatsuahnak thu lawng an rel ṭheu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuai dik lo a hmangtu pawl cu Bawipa in a hua, Asinain cuailung dikmi ah a lung a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A porh awmi pawl cun hmuhsuamnak an tong ding, Curuangah tangdor ih um a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miṭha cu dingnak in lam a hruai, Zum awk tlak lomi pawl cu anmah ihó ding lonak in a siatsuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thihnak a thlen ni ahcun lennak hi a ṭhahnem lo, Asinain dingnak in na nunnak a lo humhim thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dingnak in miṭhapa ih nunnak a nuamter, Asinain miṭha lo pawl cu an ṭhatlonak in an nunnak an tluksawn ter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dingnak in miding a luatter, Asinain zumtlak lomi cu amah ih duhhamnak in a awk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miṭha lo pa a thih tikah amah ih ruahsannak khal a thihcih, Lennak a rinsantu cu zianghman a ṭhahnem lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Miding pawl cu harsatnak ihsin run an si, Miṭha lo pawl hnen sawnah harsatnak a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ziangsiar lotu pawl ih ṭongkam in a lo siatsuah thei, Asinain miding pawl ih fimnak in a lo run thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miding pawl vanṭhatnak an ton tikah khawpi an lung a awi, Miṭha lo pawl an thih tikah lungawi in an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miding pawl in thluasuah an pek tikah khua cu a ṭhangso, Asinain miṭha lo pawl ih ṭongkam in khawpi cu a siatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi hmuhsuamnak ṭong a ṭongtu cu mi aa an si, Mifim na si ahcun na ṭong suup aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Katam pawl in thuthup an phuang ṭheu, Asinain zumtlak mi pawl in an thup thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaihhruainak um lo ahcun ram an siat, Ruahnak ṭha petu tamnak ah himnak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na theih lo mipa kha a leiba samsak dingah thu na kam ahcun na siir aw leh ding, Na tel lole na hrangah a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zaangfah thiam minu cu upat mi a si, Asinain ziaza ṭhatnak a nei lo minu cu ningzakza a si. Mi zaangzel in sumsaw a nei dah lo ding, Asinain mitaima pawl cu an lian ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi zaangfah thiam na si ahcun nangmah le nangmah hmaiṭhatnak na pe aw, Mi zaangfah nei lo na si ahcun nangmah le nangmah na siatsuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Miṭha lo pawl in hlawknak ngaingai an tong thei lo, Asinain thildik na tuah ahcun laksawng pek na si hrimhrim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zokhal ṭhatnak tuah ding a ruattu cu an nung ding, Asinain zokhal ṭhat lonak a tuah ringringtu cu an thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa in thinlung ṭha lo pawl a hua, Asinain thildik a tuahtu pawl cu a duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miṭha lo pawl hrem an si ding ticu a fiang, Asinain miding pawl cu an luat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A mawizet naón khawruah thiamnak a nei lo mi nunau cu, Vok hnar ih sui khaih bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Miṭha pawl duhnak cu ṭhatnak ah a suak ṭheu, Miṭha lo pawl in an duhmi an ngah tikah mi hmuahhmuah an thin a heng ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat siangzet in an paisa an hmang naón an lian deuh deuh, A dang pawl cu an ralring zet naón an farah sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siangzet in nung awla na lian ding, Midang va bawm awla an lo bawm ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A man kai deuh hngak in rawl a zuar siang lotu cu mi in an cam siat, Asinain zuar a siangtu cu mi in an lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na hmuitin mi a ṭhat a si ahcun upat na si ding, Asinain harsatnak na hawl ahcun, cumicu na ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lennak a rinsantu pawl cu ṭhal caan thinghnah bangin an ṭil ding. Asinain miding pawl cu tlimno bangin an hninghno ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A innsungsang tlunah harsatnak a thlentertu cu a netnak ah zianghman a nei lo ding, Mi aa pawl cu mifim pawl ih hnen-um an si ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Dingnak ih rah cu nunnak a si, Asinain ṭhat lonak in nunnak a hlohter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Miṭha pawl in leitlun ah ṭhatman an ngah ahcun, Miṭha lo le misual pawl in ziangtluk hremnak an ngah ding ti cu a fiang a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Fimnak a duhtu pawl cun an sual tikah nunsim an duh. Nunsimnak a huatu cu mi aa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in mi ṭha pawl cu a lawm; Asinain ṭhat lonak khua a khangtu pawl cu a hnong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak in mi a humhim lo; Asinain miding pawl cu hngetzet in an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nupi ṭha cu a pasal ih sui lukhuh a si; Asinain a pasal tlun ih ningzahnak a thlentertu nupi cu, a pasal ruh sungih khensar natnak vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miding cun tluang zetin mi an kom, Mi ṭha lo pawl cun mi bum ding lawng an duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih ṭongkam cu mi thahnak thu a si; Asinain miding pawl ih ṭongkam in mi a runsuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu thihnak an tong ih an ci a mit; Asinain miding innsungsaang pawl cu an santluan in a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mifim na si ahcun mi in an lo lawm ding; Mi aa na si ahcun mi in an lo hmuhsuam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mah ih nunnak hrang hna a ṭuan rerotu mizaraan si cu, Mi thupi zet vekin um ih rilrawn hnakin a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi ṭha pawl in an ṭilva an fingkhawi; Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cun an ṭilva zaangfahnak an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A law-mi lothlo pa in ei ding tampi a nei; Asinain a ṭhathnem lomi hnaṭuan ih caan cemtertu cu mi aa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih duhmi cu thil ṭha lo tuah ding hawl khi a si. Asinain miding pawl ih hrihram cu fektein a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo cu amah ih ṭongkam in a awk aw; Asinain mi ṭha cu harnak ihsin amahte a luat awter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na simmi le na tuahmi parah na covo a um; Nangmah ih tawkzawn in na ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi aa pawl in miding kan si tiah an ruat aw ringring ṭheu; Mifim pawl cun ruahnak pekmi an ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi aa cun a thinhennak zamrangin a langter; Mifim cun mi ih zomtaihnak hman daitein a um san.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thudik na simnak in felnak a langter; Asinain thuphan in fel lonak lamah a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ruahnak nei cuca lo ṭongkam cun nam vekin thuk zetin mi a sun; Asinain mifim ih ṭongkam in hma a damter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuphan in nunnak caan tawite a nei; Asinain thudik cu kumkhua in a nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak thil a ngaituahtu cu amah le amah a bum aw; Asinain daihnak remreltu pawl hnenah lungawinak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miding pawl hnenah thil ṭha lo a thleng lo; Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cun harnak lawnglawng an tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa in thuphan pertu pawl a hua; Asinain miding rintlak pawl cu a lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mifim pawl cu an theihmi thu khalah dai tein an um; Asinain mi aa pawl cun an aatnak kha an langter ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hnaṭuan taimaknak in uknak huham a lo pe ding ih, Zaangzelnak in sal ah a lo canter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Donharnak in na lungawinak a dawi hlo ding; Asinain zaangfahnak ṭongkam in thazaang a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Miding pa cu a rualpi ih lamhruaitu a si; Asinain mi ṭha lo pa ih lamzin in rualpi pawl lam a pialter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi zaangzel pawl cun ram an toih hmanah sakahmi an nei lo; Asinain mi taima pawl cun thil man sunglawi bik an khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Dingnak cu nunnak lampi a si ih, ṭhat lonak cu thihnak lampi a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Fapa fim cu a pa in nun a sim tikah a ngai; Asinain mi hngal cun ka sual ngai a ti dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ṭha cun an ṭongkam ih rah an ei ding; Asinain mibum hmang pawl cun ṭhat lonak lawng an hiar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na simmi ralring awla na nunnak kha humhim a si ding; Ralring loih a ṭongtu cun amah le amah a siatsuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi zaangzel cun thil tampi a duh zet ṭheu; Asinain zianghman a ngah cuang lo; Hnaṭuan zetmi cun a duh mi pohpoh a ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miding pawl in thudik lo an hua, Asinain mi ṭha lo ṭongkam pawl cu ningzakza le fihnungza a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dingnak in sualnak nei lo pawl a humhim; ṭhat lonak cu misual pawl ih tluknak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat pawl cu milian vekin an um; Asinain zianghman an nei lo; Mi hrekkhat cu farah vekin an um, Asinain thilri tampi an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Milian in an nunnak tlennak ah paisa hman ding an nei; Asinain mi farah cu zohman in an hringhro lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Miding pawl ih tleunak cu a tleu cuang a bang; Mi ṭha lo pawl ih meikhuat cu a mit cing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puarthaunak cun harsatnak lawng a suahter; Mi dang ruahnak thuron cu fimdeuhnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ol-ai deuh ih na ngahmi lennak cu, A rei hlanah a hlo vivo ding; Harsazet ih na hlawhmi cu rei a daih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ruahsannak ngah lohli lo tikah thinlung a na; Asinain saduhthah mi a kim tikah nunnak cu lungawinak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nunsimnak thu zianghman a siar lotu pawl cu anmah le anmah an siat awter ding; Nunsimnak thu a thlun mi pawl cu an him ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mifim mi pawl ih zirhnak cu nunnak cerhti a si; Cu pawl in na nunnak cu ṭihphannak sungih a um tikah, an luatter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Fimthiamnak in upatnak a hlawh, Asinain zumtlak a si lomi pawl cu siatnak lamzin ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mifim pawl cu thil an tuah hlanah khua an ruatta ṭheu; Asinain mi aa pawl cun an aatnak sawn an phuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rinsan tlak lo tlang-autu pawl in harnak an suahter; Asinain zumtlakmi palai pawl in daihnak an suahpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nunsimnak ngai duh lo cu farahnak le mualphonak a si; Asinain nunsimnak a ngaitu cu upatnak an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saduhthah mi ngah hi ziangtluk in a ṭha; Mi aa pawl cun ṭhat lonak ihsin kirsal ding an duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mifim pawl thawn umtlang awla na fim ding; Mi aa na pawl a si ahcun harnak na tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Misual pawl cu harsatnak in hmunzakip ah a thlun; Asinain miding pawl cu ṭhatnak laksawng an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi ṭha in a tu le a fa tiangin a lennak a roh ding; Asinain misual pawl ih lennak cu miding pawl kutah a thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thlawh lomi loram ihsin farah hrangah rawl tampi a suah ding; Asinain dingthluk lairelnak a um lo ruangah a suakmi rawl hman an sung lam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na fapa na hrem lo ahcun amah na duhdaw lo a si; Na duhdawt a si ahcun nun na sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Miding pawl in eikhop rawl an nei; Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cu kumkhua in an ril a rawng.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nunau fim pawl in an inn an sak; Asinain a aa pawl in anmah kut lala in an balsiat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Miding pawl in Bawipa an ṭihzah; Asinain mi hrokhrawl pawl cun ziangah an siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi aa hngal in tamtuk an ṭong ih, Mifim pa ih ṭongkam in amah kha a humhim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnaṭuantu ding cawcang pawl an um lo ahcun, na cuam cu a lawng ding; Asinain cawcang pawl ih thazaang in rawl tampi a suah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rintlak mi thutheitu in thudik a sim ṭheu; Asinain rintlak lomi cun thuphan lawnglawng a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi puarthau pawl cu mifim an cang thei dah lo; Asinain mifim pawl cun ol ngaiten thu an zir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi aa pawl kiangkap ah um hlah; Nangmah lo zirh ding zianghman an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangruangah mifim cu a fim? Ziang ka tuah ding ti a theih ruangah a fim. Ziangruangah mi aa cu a aat? Ka thei a si tiah a ruah awk ruangah a aa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi aa pawl cu an sual khalah sual sir awk ti an thei lo. Asinain miding cun ngaihthiam mi si ding kha an duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lungawinak cu nangmah ih ta a si; Na riahsiatnak khal nangmah ih ta a si; Zohman in an lo ṭawmpi thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pa ih inn a siat ṭheh hnu hmanah, Mi ṭha pa ih deu cu a fek ringring hrih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihrek in lamzin dik tiih an ruahmi A netnak ah thihnak ih mi hruaitu lamzin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnih-nak aw in riahsiatnak aw a thup thei; Sikhalsehla lungawinak a cem tikah, Riahsiatnak cu a taang ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo in an ṭhat lo man an ngah ding ih, Mi ṭha in an ṭhat man an ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ruahnak mal pawl in ziang hmuahhmuah an zum; Mifim pawl cun an fehnak kha ṭhatein an zohta ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mifim pawl cu ralring tein an um ih ṭhat lonak kha an hrial; Asinain mi aa cun ralrinnak nei loin zamrang tukin an tuah ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi thintawi pawl cu at-hlawh zetin thil an tuah; Asinain mifim deuh pawl cu tangdorte in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ruahnak mal pawl cu aat man an ngah ding; Asinain mifim cun an fim man ah fimthiamnak an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu mi ṭha pawl hmaiah an kun ih, Mithmai ṭha ngah dingin zaangfah an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mifarah pawl cu an innhnen hman in an hrial; Asinain milian pawl cu rualpi tampi an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi lungawi si na duh ahcun, mi farah va zaangfah aw; Midang hmuhsuam cu sualnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ṭhatnak hrang lawng khua na khan ahcun, Mi in an lo zum ding ih an lo upat ding. Asinain ṭhat lonak hrang khuakhan cu palhnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hnaṭuan khung ṭuan awla na cawm aw thei ding; To men ih ṭong rero cu farahnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mifim pawl cu lennak laksawng pek an si ding; Asinain mi aa pawl cu an aatnak in theih thei an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thudik simtu thutheitu cun nunnak a humhim ding; Asinain thuphan a pertu cu mi zuartu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathian ṭihzahnak in mi pakhat le a innsang hnenah, mah le mah rinsan awknak le humhimnak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thihnak in luat na duh maw? Bawipa ṭihzah cu nunnak cerhti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siangpahrang ih hu le thawm cu, a ukmi tam le mal parah a um; A ukmi an um lo ahcun amah lawng cu zianghman a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thinsau mi cu mifim a si; Asinain na thin a tawi ahcun na aatnak kha na langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thindaihnak in pumsa a damter; Asinain iksiiknak cu ruh hrangah khensar natnak vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi farah pawl na hrem ahcun, mi farah pawl sersiamtu Pathian na nautat a si; Asinain farah pawl zaangfahtu cu Pathian ṭihzahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu anmah ih tuahmi ṭhatlonak in siatnak a thlenpi; Asinain mi ṭha pawl cu anmah ih felnak in a humhim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Fimnak cu mifim pawl ih lung sungah a um ih, Mi aa pawl ih lung sungah cun umnak hmun a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dingnak in miphun a cawisaang; Sualnak cun miphun mual a photer.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Siangpahrang in a felmi a hnaṭuantu pawl a lawm; Asinain a fel lomi hnaṭuantu pawl cu a hrem.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Awkaa neem ih thulehnak in thinhengnak a daiter; Asinain ṭong hrang in thinhengnak a suahter sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mifim pawl ih lei in fimnak a karhter, Mi aa pawl ih kaa in aatnak a suahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in hmunkipih a cangmi thil hmuahhmuah a hmu ṭheh; ṭhatnak kan tuah ah siseh, siatnak kan tuah ah siseh, in zoh ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zaangfahnak ṭongkam in thinlung a nungter sal; Asinain zaangfahnak um lo ṭongkam cun thinlung a kuaiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pa ih nunsimnak a eltu cu mi aa an si; Nunsimnak a saangtu cu mifim an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miding in an sumsaw an khawl; Asinain mi ṭha lo cun harnak a thlen tikah an rak hmang ral zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mifim pawl ruangah fimnak a karhzai; Mi aa pawl ruangih karhzai a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi ṭha pawl thla an cam tikah Bawipa a lung a awi; Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl ih an kenmi raithawinak cu a fih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih thil tuahzia cu Bawipa in a hua; Asinain dingnak a tuahtu pawl cu a duhdawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil sual na tuah ahcun nazet ih hremnak na tuar ding; Nunsimnak na duh lo ahcun na thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mithi khua Sheol le hngilhnak ram sungih a ummi pawl khal khi Bawipa in a hmu ṭheh; Ziangtin so minung in an ruahnak kha Pathian hmai ihsin an thuh thiam ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi hngal pawl cun nunsim an duh lo; A fim deuh pawl hnen ihsin ruahnak khal an dil dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Minung cu an lungawi tikah an mithmai a ṭha; Asinain an riahsiat tikah an thin a nau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mifim pawl cun zir ding an duh; Asinain mi aa pawl cu an aatnak ah khan an lung a kim ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mifarah pawl cu lungrethei ringring in an um; Milungawi pawl cu an nun a nuam ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa ṭihphah ih malte neih hi, lian ih thinphang rero hnakin a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Duhdawtmi pawl thawn hanghnah hangrah ei cu, Huatawknak hmun ih sa thaw bik ei hnakin a thaw deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thintawinak in tawhawknak a suahter; Asinain thinsaunak in remnak a thlenter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mizaangzel na si ahcun hmunkipah harnak na tong ding; Miding na si ahcun harsatnak na nei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Fapa fim in a pa ih lung a awiter; Mi aa lawngin a nu kha a hmuhsuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi aa pawl cu anmah ih aatnak ah an thin a nuam; Asinain mifim cun dingnak kha a tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ruahnak tam deuh na lak tik poh ah na hlawhtling ding; Cu lo ahcun na hlawhsam ringring ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A caan thawn a remmi ṭongkam ṭong ngah cu, ziangtlukin so a ṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mifim cu thihnak lam ah vung feh loin, nunnak lamzin ah a hung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa in mihngal pawl ih inn cu a siatbal ding; Asinain nuhmei nu ih thilri kha a kilveng ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bawipa in ruahnak ṭha lo pawl cu a hua; Asinain rem awknak ṭongkam ah a lung a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dik lozet ih hlawknak ngah na tum ahcun, Na innsang na buaiter ding. Nawhthuh lak hlah awla na san a sau ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi ṭha pawl cun thu leh hlanah an ruat hmaisa ṭheu; Mi ṭha lo pawl cun zamrang in an let ih buainak an suahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi ṭha pawl thla an cam tikah Bawipa in a ngai; Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl ih thlacamnak cu a hnong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mithmai ṭha in mi lung a awiter, Cule thuthang ṭha cun ruh sung tiangin damnak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nunsimnak ṭhatein na ngai ahcun mifim na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Zir ding na el ahcun nangmah le nangmah na hmuhsuam aw a si. Nunsimnak na saan ahcun na fim deuh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipa ṭihzah hi fim zirnak a si. Upatnak na co theinak dingah tangdor hmaisa aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minung in khua cu kan khaang ko ding; Asinain a cemnak ih thuneitu cu Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu a ṭha ṭheh in na ruat ko ding; Asinain Bawipa cun thinlung lam a zoh sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu Bawipa ih hnenah hlaan aw; Na khawkhannak ah na hlawhtling ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in thil hmuahhmuah hi cemnetnak nei in a tuah; Cuvekin mi ṭha lo ih cemnetnak cu siatralnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in mi hngalhngawng pawl cu a hua; Cuvek pawl cu hremnak in a luatter lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian hnenah felzet le zumtlak zetin um awla na sualnak a lo ngaithiam ding; Bawipa ih thu ngai awla ṭhat lonak na hrial thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa ih lung na awiter tikah na ral pawl hman na rualpi ah na tuah thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Fel lonak thawn paisa tampi neih hnakin, Felte in hlawh ih paisa malte neih hi a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khawkhannak cu na nei ko ding; Asinain na tuahmi pawlah lam a lo hruaitu cu Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang cun Pathian ih hu le ham thawn thu a rel; A hmurka in a suakmi pawl cu a dik ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuai le tahnak pawl cu Pathian in dikteih tuah a duh; Zuar mi hmuahhmuah khal felteih tuah a duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak tuah hi siangpahrang pawl in an duh lo; Ziangahtile uknak fektertu cu dingnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siangpahrang in thudik theih a duh ih, Thudik ṭongtu kha mithmaiṭha a pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mifim cun siangpahrang lungawiter ding a zuam; Siangpahrang a thin a hen ahcun pakhatkhat an thi men thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siangpahrang ih mithmai a ṭhat tikah nunnak a um; A zaangfahnak cu ṭhalruah kengtu khawdur bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fimnak hi sui hnakin a ṭha deuh; Theihthiamnak hi ngun hnakin hril deuh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi ṭha pawl cun ṭhat lonak a hrialtu lamzin an thlun; Curuangah khuitawk lam na pan ti kha zoh ṭha aw; Na nunnak a lo run thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hngalnak in siatralnak a thlenter; Porh awknak in ṭumsuknak ah mi a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mifarah thawn tangdorte ih um cu, Mi puarthau pawl thawn hransaw ṭhen awk hnakin a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An lo zirhmi kha ṭhatein ngai awla na hlawhtling ding; Bawipa kha rinsan awla na lung a awi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thinlung fimmi cu thil a thlei dang theitu an si; Awkaa thlum in mi a hiip thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mifim hrangah fimnak cu nunnak cerhti a si; Asinain mi aa fim zirh tum cu caan a cem lak meen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mifim pawl cun an ṭong hlanah khua an ruat; Curuangah an simmi cu hmual a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zaangfahnak ṭongkam cu khuaitizu vek a si; Kaa sungah a thlum ih harhdamnak hrangah a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lamzin dik a si tiih na ruahmi kha, Thihnak ah a lo thlenpitu lamzin a si thei meen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hnaṭuantu cu rawl a hiarnak in tam deuh hna a ṭuanter; Ziangahtile a ril rawnnak kha riamter a duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cun midang harsatnak pek ding lam an hawl; An ṭongkam hman in mi a kaang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl in mi relsiatnak an karhter; Harnak an suahter ih rualpi ṭha hman an ṭhen-awter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi helhlong pawl in rualpi pawl an bum ih, siatralnak lamah mi an hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mit a lo sin duapdotu le kam a lo sehtu cu va ralring aw; Ziangahtile ṭhat lonak ruattu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nunsaunak cu miding pawl ih covo a si; Sam par cu sunlawinak lukhuh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thinsau cu thacahnak hnakin a ṭha deuh; Mah le mah uk theinak cu khawpi tampi uk theinak hnakin a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian ih tumtahnak thei dingah camcawhfung an zuuk; Asinain a thulehnak cu amah Pathian ih lairelmi a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rem-awklonak inn ih puai zawh hnakin, Thinlung hnadaite ih buhṭhing tlangkhat ei a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A fim zetmi sal cu a bawipa ih fapa santlai lomi tlunah, Thuneihnak a ngah ding ih ro ṭhen khat a co ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sui le ngun cu meisa in hniksak an si; Minung thinlung cu Bawipa in a hniksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cun ruahnak ṭha lo an thlun ih, thuphanpertu pawl in thuphan thu kha an ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mifarah na zawmtai a si ahcun a sersiamtu Pathian na zawmtai a si; Mi in vansiatnak an ton tikah na di a riam ahcun hrem na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tar pawl ih bawi lukhuh cu an tu le fa pawl an si; Nauhak pawl ih sunlawinak cu an nu le pa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Upat tlakmi pawl in thuphan an sim lo; Mi aa pawl cun a remcaan laiah simrel ding an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat pawl in nawhthuh cu mitkher vekin hna a ṭuan thei ding tiin an ruat; Ziang hmuahhmuah a tuah thei tiah an zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi in nangmah a lo duhdawt ding na duh a si ahcun, An sual tikah va ngaithiam aw; Sualpalhnak ciin ringringnak in rualpi a ṭhen thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi aa voi zakhat thawi hnakin, Mifim voi khat kawk a luut thuuk sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harnak a suakter ringringtu mi ṭha lo pawl hnenah, Thihnak kha zualkotu bangin thlah a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A fa lonsak mi vompi ton hi, Mi aa buai rero lai ton hnakin a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ṭhatnak kha ṭhat lonak ih a lehrultu cu, ṭhat lonak khan a inn ihsin a suahsan lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tawhawknak hramthok cu tidai khamtu kuai hramthok vek a si; Sualawknak a um hlanah baang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sualnak nei lo mawhthluk le mi ṭha lo thiam coter hi, An pahnih in Bawipa ih huat zawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi aa fim zirhnak hrangih tangka tampi cem hi ziangso a ṭhahnem? Ziangahtile a fim cuang lo ding; Fim theinak thinlung a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rualpi ṭha in duhdawtnak an langter ringring; Harsatnak caanih kan bawm-awk lo ah unau si man ziangso a um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawruahnak nei lo mi aa lawng in mi dang ih leiba hrangah, ṭuanvo lakin thu a kam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sualnak duh cu harsatnak tuah duh thawn a bang; Na uar awk rero ahcun harsatnak na sawm thawn a bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thinlung ṭha lo minung cu a lamzin a tluang lo; Mibum hmang lei cu siatralnak sungah a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Fapa aa cun riahsiatnak a suahter; Fapa aa a neitu cu lungawinak a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lungawinak hi sii ṭhazet a si. Thinharnak in ruh a roter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuṭhentu misual pawl cun, Nawhthuh an lak thup ih dingthluk lairelnak a um thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mifim pawl cun thil ṭha tuah ding an thei; Asinain mi aa pawl cu an thinlung a vaangza.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Fapa aa in pa ih hnenah thinharnak a thlenter ih, A nu ih hnenah lungretheihnak a thlenter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sualnak nei lomi hrem cu a dik lo; Mi ṭha pawl vuak cu a sia sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mifim pawl in tampi an ṭong lem lo; Daite in a ummi cu thildik hmu theitu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi aa hman daitein a um ahcun, mifim ah ruah a si; A kaa a ciip ahcun, mifim bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Midang thawn a pawlkom aw thei hrimhrim lomi cu, Mah ih duhnak lawng ruattu an si. Midang ruahnak cu a pom thei dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi aa cun thu a theih le theih lo kha thupi ah a ruat lo; Ziangtluk ka fim ti langter ding lawng a duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sualnak le ningzah mualphonak cu an feh tlang ringring; Upatnak na hlohter ahcun a ai ah hmuhsuamnak na ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minung ṭongkam hi fimnak hram a si thei; Tipithuanthum vekin a thuk thei ih, A luang ringring mi tiva vekin a thar ringring thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl mithmaiṭha pek cu a dik lomi a si; Miding thiamlo coter khal a dik lomi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi aa hmur in tawhawknak a suak; Cun a kaa in vuakvelhnak a sawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi aa a ṭong tikah amah le amah a siatsuah aw rero; A ṭongmi in amah le amah a awk aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi relsiatnak thu cu a thaw nasa; A thlum zet ih kan dolh hluahhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi zaangzel cu mi siatsuahtu tluk ih sia a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa cu a hngetmi beunak inn donhleisang a si; Miding pawl cu cutawkah an feh ih an him.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Milian pawl in an sumsaw kha himnak ah an ruat; A saang ih a fek zetmi khawpi kulhnak hauhruang ah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zokhal tangdornak a neih hlan lo cu upatnak pek a si dah lo; Mi hngal pawl cu siatnak lamzin ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu na leh hlanah ṭhatein ngai hmaisata aw; Cutin na tuah lole mi aa na si ih hlei ah thu na leh mi kha na hmuhsuam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Minung thinlung in natnak a tuar thei; Sikhalsehla zoso thinlung kuai cu a tuar thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mifim pawl cu zir duhnak thinlung an nei ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi thupi mi ton na duh maw? Thil ṭhen ding keng awla olte in na tong thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuṭhennak zungah thu a sim hmaisa biktu cu mi dik bik a bang; Sikhalsehla cutiih a bangnak cu amah a eltupa in thu a sut ih a hlathlai ciamco tik tiang lawng a daih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thutheizet veve pahnih thuṭhennak zungah thu an el awk ahcun, Camcawhfung lawngin an thu a ṭhen thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na unau bawm awla anih in a fekmi khawpi hauhruang vekin a lo hum ding; Asinain na tawh a si ahcun na hrangah a sangka a khar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ṭong ih a suahtermi rah in na pum a lo puarter ding; Na hmur ihsin a suakmi in na lung a lo kimter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na ṭongkam in na nunnak a himter thei vekin siatnak khalah a siatter thei; Curuangah na ṭongkam ruangih a ra thlengmi thil pawl cu na tuar thei a ṭul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nupi ton cu thil ṭha ton a si; Cumi in Bawipa ih ṭhatnak na parah a langter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mifarah a ṭong tikah a dil tein a dil ṭheu; Sikhalsehla milian pa cun awkaa hrang in mi a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rualpi hrekkhat cu caan tawite sung lawng an hmun; Sikhalsehla rualpi ṭhenkhat cu unau hnakin mi an tlaihsan sawn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A dingmi mifarah si cu a hrokhrawlmi mi aa hnakin a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Theihnak um lo ih a duh lawng duh cu a ṭha lo; Thinsaunak um lo cun harnak ton a olte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minung in mah ih aatnak ruangah siatralnak an tong ṭheu; Cutikah Bawipa an mawhthluk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lennak in rualpi thar tampi a suahter; Sikhalsehla mifarah cu a rualpi cia hman in an tlansan ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuṭhennak zungah thuphan na sim asile, Cawhkuan na tong ding, na luatnak a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mitampi in mi thupi pawl hnenin mithmaiṭha ngah an zuam; Mi tirhsiang hrang ahcun zokhal rualpi ṭha an si ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mifarah cu a suahpi unau hman in an hnong ṭheu; Theihthiam mi rualpi menmen pawl cun ziangtlukin so an tlansan sinsin ding! Ziangtluk ih a kawh hai rero khalle an kir nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah le nangmah duhdaw awla, Fimnak kha na zir thei tawkin zir aw; Na zirmi kha ciing ringring awla, Na thil tuahmi ah na hlawhtling ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A dik lomi thutheitu cu hremnak in a luat lo ding; Thuphan a simtu cu a siatral ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi aa cu nunnuam zetin nung dingah a tlak lo; Sal ih bawi uk ding cu a tlak lo sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na fim asile na thinlung na uk thei ding, Mi ih sualnak ngaithiam cu thil sunglawi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siangpahrang thinhengnak cu kiosa huuk bangtuk a si; Sikhalsehla a zaangfahnak cu hrampi parih tladai bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fapa aa in siatralnak ah a pa a thlenpi; A phunzai ringringmi nupi cu catbaang loin a surmi ruah bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Inn le sumsaw cu nu le pa hnenih ngahmi rothil an si; Sikhalsehla nupi fim cu Bawipa ih hnen ihsin ngahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zaangzel in na it ringring men asile, na ril a rawng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian thukham thlun awla na nunkhua a sau ding; Ziangsiar loin na um asile na thi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi farah parih zaangfahnak neih cu Bawipa ih hnen ih thil pek bangtuk a si; Bawipa amah in a lo pe sal leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na faale kha an no laiah nun sim aw; Na sim lo asile anmah le anmah siatsuah aw dingin na bawm a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nasa zetih thinhengtu cu hremnak a tong ding; Harnak sungin voi khat run hman awla na run sal a ṭul thotho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ruahnak pekmi kha na ngai ih zirnak na neih asile, Nikhat khat ahcun mifim na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Minung cun a thinlung in khaw- khannak tampi a nei ko ding; Sikhalsehla Bawipa ih khawkhannak lawng tuah a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Duhham hi ningzahnak a si; Mifarah si hi thuphanpertu si hnakin a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa ṭihzah awla na nunkhua a sau ding; Siatralnak tong loin na him ding ih na hna a ngam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihrek cu an zaang a zel tukih, An kaa sungih rawl baar ding hman an zuam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi puarthau hrem awla, ruahnak mal in fimnak a ngah ding; Mifim na si ahcun nunsimnak ihsin fim na zir ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pa a thawi ih a nu kha inn ihsin a dawitu fapa cu, Ningzahnak le mualphonak a suah tertu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka fapa, zirnak na bansan ahcun na theih ciami kha na hngilh sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Midang siatnak lawng a ruattu thutheihpitu hnenah cun dingnak a um lo; Mi ṭha lo pawl in sualnak tuah an duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi hngal pawl cu thawi an tong ding. Mi aa pawl cu vuak an hlawh ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zu in cu mi hmuhsuam tonnak a si; ṭongkam a tamter ih tawhawknak a suahter. Zurit cu aat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thin a hengmi siangpahrang cu a hruum durdomi kiosa na ṭih vekin ṭih aw; Amah a thin a hengtertu cu mah le mah that-aw bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zovek mi aa khal in tawhawknak cu a suahter thei; Tawhawknak hrial thei cu upat tlak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lo rih tikcu caan ih lothlawh a zuam lotu mi zaangzel cu, rawl lak tikcu ah rawl khawm ding a nei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minung in a thinlung sungih a neih mi ruahnak cu tikhur thuk sungih tidai bangtuk a si; Sikhalsehla mifim pa in a khaisuak thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zokhal in mah ih felnak fingfing an sim cio; Sikhalsehla zoso mifel taktak a tong thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pa cu miding le miṭha a si ahcun, A faale pawl mi vanṭha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuṭhennak tokham ih a tomi siangpahrang cun, Thil ṭha lo hmuahhmuah kha a mit in a thleidang thluh thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zoso, “Ka thinlung ka thianter zo, Ka sualnak in ka thiang zo,” a ti thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in cuai le tahnak dik lo pawl a hua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nauhak khal in a sinak a nuncan daan a thiang le thiang lo, A dik le dik lo kha a tuahnak in a langter ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmuhnak mit le theihnak hna cu, Bawipa ih tuahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tikcu caan ihnak in na cemter asile na farah ding; Hna ṭuan ringring awla rawl tampi na nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil leitu in, “A man a tamtuk!” tiah a phunzai ṭheu; Sikhalsehla a lei ih a feh hnuah cun, “Olte in ka lei,” tiah a porh aw ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sui tampi a um, lungvar khal tampi a um; Sikhalsehla fimnak ṭongkam cu a man a khung sawnmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Theih dah lomi pa hrangah aamahkhan saktu cu, A thilri aamahkhannak hrangah laksak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hrokhrawl in ngahmi rawl cu a thaw; Sikhalsehla rei lo ah a kaa sungah vunnel bangtuk a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ruahnak ṭha a neimi thawn thu va ron aw; Na thiltuahmi ah na hlawhtling ding. Ṭhatein timtuahta loin ral do hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thupte in mi rel a hmangtu in thuthup kha a phuang ṭheu; Curuangah mi rel a hmangtu kha va kom hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na nu le na pa na camsiat asile, Khawthim lakih mei-inn mit bangin na nunnak a cem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Olte ih na ngahmi sumsaw cu na hrangah ṭhathnemnak a mal ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ṭhat lonak kha ṭhat lonak in lehrul hlah; Bawipa rinsan awla a lo run ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A dik lomi cuai le tahnak a hmangtu pawl cu Bawipa in a hua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan lamzin ah kan ke kar in hruaitu cu Bawipa a si; Minung in ziangtinso an fehnak ding lamzin an theih thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian hnen thawhlawm pek ding thu na kam hlanah ṭhatein ruat hmaisata aw; Culole neh hnuah na siir aw pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A fimmi siangpahrang cun misual kha a hawl ih zaangfah loin a hrem ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa in ruahnak le siaṭha thleidan theinak thinlung in pek; Kan thinlung hnen ihsin khuiah so kan relh thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siangpahrang in felnak le ṭhatnak le dingnak thawn, A ram a uk sung hmuah cu a uknak a hnget ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mino pawl ih sunlawinak cu an thazaang a si; Putar pawl ih mawinak cu an sampar hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thawinak hma kan ton ruangah kan ṭhat lonak a thiang; Vuaknak kan ton ruangah thinlung thianfainak kan ngah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang ih thinlung cu Bawipa ih kut sungah a um; Tiva luannak a thleng awk bangin Amah ih duhnak poh ah a mer.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zokhal in mah ih nundaan cio hi a dik in kan ruat; Sikhalsehla Bawipa cun kan thinlung a zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dingnak le a dikmi tuah cu raithawinak hnakin Bawipa in a duh sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu porhawknak le puarthaunak in a uk; Himi cu sualnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭhatein khuakhangta in na ṭuan asile na hlawh a tling ding; Sikhalsehla zamrang in na ṭuan asile khopkham in na nei thei dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hrokhrawlnak in ngahmi sumsaw cu a zuangmi tikhu le thihnak thang an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu anmah ih tuahmi ṭhatlonak in a siatralter ding; Ziangahtile a dingmi thil tuah an duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih lamzin cu a kawi, Sikhalsehla mithiang mi in thil dik an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A phunzai ringringmi nupi thawn innpi sungih umtlang hnakin, inn luanglu kelkawmte ih mahte um a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl cu thil ṭha lo tuah an duh ringring; Zo ih par khalah zaangfahnak thinlung an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi puarthau hrem a si tikah mi aa in fimnak a ngah; Sikhalsehla mifim cu an zirh tikah a fimnak a karh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A dingmi Pathian cun mi ṭha lo pawl ih inn ah ziang a cang ti kha a thei ṭheh ih, Mi ṭha lo kha siatnak ah a thlenter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mifarah pawl ih aunak aw a ngai duh lotu cu, Amah ih au tikah zokhal in an theihpi ve lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thupte ih pekmi laksawng in thinhengnak a daihter; Puan thuaiih pekmi nawhthuh in thinlingnak a nemter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thu pakhatkhat dingtein rel a si tikah miding pawl hrangah lungawinak a si; Sikhalsehla mi ṭha lo pawl hrang ahcun riahsiatnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fimnak lamzin ihsin a pialmi pawl cu thihnak in a bawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nomnak a duhtu cu a farah ding; Zu le sa a duhtu cu a lian dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl in mi ṭha pawl par ih an tlunter tummi harnak cu, Anmah ih par lala ah a tlung ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A phunzaimi le mi tawh a hmangmi nunau thawn umtlang hnak cun, Nelrawn ih va um ziar khi a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mifim umnak ah lennak le nomnak a um; Asinain mi aa cun paisa an ngah vete in an ei-ek ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dingnak le zaangfahnak nei awla na nun a sau ding; Midang khal in an lo upat ding ih ṭhatein an lo tuamhlawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A fimmi ralbawi cun micak pawl ih kilmi khawpi a la thei ih, an rinsanmi hauhruang khal a siat thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A lei le a kaa a kil theitu cu harnak in a luat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi puarthau, mi porh-aw le hngal zetih a nungmi pa cu, A hmin ah, “Mi hmuhsuamtu,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hnaṭuan zianghman a zuam lomi mi zaangzel cu, Amah le amah a that aw rero a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sunvu a ruahmi cu ziang ka ngah pei ti lawng a si. Asinain miding pawl cun ui loin siangzet in an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi ṭha loih raithawinak cu Bawipa in a fih; Thinlungput ṭha lo thawn a tuahmi cu a fih sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuphanper a dik lomi theihpitu cu a siatral ding; Sikhalsehla thudik a simtu ih thu cu cohlan a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Miding cu amah le amah a rinsan aw ṭheu; Sikhalsehla mi ṭha lo cun a titer aw ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bawipa na dodal a si ahcun milai ih fimnak, thiamnak le theihfiangnak pawl in a lo bawm thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Raldonak ni hrangah rang tla cu timtuahcia an si; Sikhalsehla nehnak cu Bawipa hnenin a rami a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lennak hnakin hminṭhatnak hril ding a si sawn; Zaangfahnak cu sui le ngun hnakin a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mifarah le milian an bangawknak zawnte a um; Cumi cu Bawipa ih sersiammi veve an sinak hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mifim cu harnak a rat kha a hmuh tikah a hrial; Sikhalsehla mi aa cun a pahcih hluahhlo ih neh hnuah a sir aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangdor in Bawipa ṭihzah awla, Lennak, upatnak le nunsaunak na ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ih lamzin cu hling le thang in a khat; Mah ih nunnak a duhtu cun hlatpi in a hrial ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nauhak kha nundaan dik zirh aw, A tar tiangin cuih lamzin ihsin a pial lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mifarah cu milian ih sal a si, Cawitu cu coihtu ih sal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dinglonak thlaici na tuh asile harsatnak na at ding; Midang pawl na hrem theinak khal a reh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tirhsiang awla na rawl kha farah pawl hlawm aw; Thlawsuah na ngah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi puarthau dawihlo uhla buainak a reh ding; Tawhawknak le nautatawknak khal a hlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thinlung thiang a keng ih awkaa thlum a nei mi cun, Siangpahrang a rualpi ah a tuah thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in thuphan a simtu pawl a dawihlo ih, Thudik a simtu pawl kha himte in a kilveng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi zaangzel cu inn ah a um men, Innleng ka suak asile kiosa in i keuthat ding, a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlawhhlangnu ih hmurka cu a thukmi khur a si; Bawipa ih thinhengnak a tuahtu pawl cu cuih khur sungah an tla ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nauhak thinlung sungah huatsuahnak a um ringring; Nunsimnak fung cun ṭha deuh in a zirh thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mah ih lennak duh ruangih mi farah a hremtu le, Milian a tlontu cu a farah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na hna i tun aw, mifim pawl ih thusimmi ka lo zirh ding; Cun ka fimthiamnak na thinlung sungah ciing aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na thinlung sungah na ret asile na lung a awi ding; Na hmurka ah ralring cia in an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa kha rinsan aw, tiah ka lo duhsak; Curuangah himi thu pawl tuih ni ah ka lo zirhnak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangmah ih hrangah thufim sawmthum ka lo ngansak; Hi thufim pawl cu fimnak le ruahnak ṭha thawn a khatmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule hi thufim pawl in thudik a lo theihter ding ih, Nangmah tirh a lo fialtu kha diktein thu na sim thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mifarah kha a farah ruangah a thil va long hlah, Thuṭhennak zung sung khal ah va hrem hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ziangahtile Bawipa in an thu a ṭanpi ding ih, Anmah a siatsuahtu pawl ih nunnak kha a siatter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thinheng a hmangmi le thintawimi va kom hlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ziangruangah tile, an nundaan na cawng ngah pang asile, na ṭhin thei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Midang leiba hrangah ṭuanvo laak in thu va kam hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na sam thei lo asile na ihkhun hman an lo laksak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nan pupa pawl ih an rak tuahcia mi ramri kha ṭhawn hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A hnaṭuannak ih a thiamzetmi na hmu maw? Amah cu mizaraan hnenah si loin siangpahrang hnenah a ṭuan ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uktu bawi thawn rawl na ei tikah, Na hmaiah zoso a um ti kha ṭhatein zoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rawlphammi na si ahcun sup aw deuh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lo pekmi rawl thawthaw kha hahio hlah; Ziangahtile an lo bumnak rawl a si thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na nunnak siatsuah aw tiangtiang in lennak va hawl hlah; A colh hna thiam in fim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangruangah tile na paisa cu mit ṭhep karah a hlo theimi a si; Thla bun hruak in mupi bangin a zuanghlo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tirhfaakmi ih rawl va ei hlah, Rawl thaw a lo domi khal va hahio hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziangruangah tile a thinlung put bangtuk in a nunzia cu a si: “In aw, ei aw,” a lo ti ding; Sikhalsehla cumi cu a thinlungtak in a lo timi a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na eimi hmuahhmuah kha na luak sal ṭheh ding ih, Na faknak awkam hmuahhmuah khal thulolak a si ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi aa theih ah thu sim hlah, Ziangahtile fimnak thu na relmi kha a nautat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hlanlai ih tuahciami ramri kha ṭhawn hlah; Nu le pa nei lo pawl ih lo khal va long hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziangahtile Bawipa cu a cakmi anmah ṭantu a si ih, Thukhingkhainak hmunah an lamah a ṭang ding ih an thu a simsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lo zirhtu pawl thu kha ṭhatein ngai awla, Fimnak kha na zir thei zat in zir aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nauhak nunsim loin um hlah, Fung in na thawi ruangah a thi lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nunnak kha thihnak ihsin na run ngah sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka fapa, na fim asile ka lung a awizet ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fimnak thu na sim ka theih tikah ka lung a nuam ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Misual pawl kha va daw hlah, Na nun sung Bawipa ṭihzah in um sawn aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutin na um asile na hmailam a tleu ding ih, na ruahsannak a hlo lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka fapa, ngai aw, fim awla, Lamzin dik kha thlun ringring aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zu le sa a phaam mi pawl va kom hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ziangahtile zu phaam le sa phaam pawl cu an farah ding; Na tikcu le caan kha ei le ih lawngin na cemter a si ahcun, A rei hlanah puansia na sin ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A lo hringtu na pa ih thu ngai aw; Amah um hlah sehla na seem lo ding. Na nu kha a tar tikah nautat hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thutak kha lei awla zuar nawn hlah; Fimnak, thuzirhnak le theihnak tla kha lei awla zuar nawn hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Miding mi ih pa cu a lung a awi nasa ding; Fapa fim hringtu cu a fapa parah a lung a awi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na nu le na pa lungawiter aw, Nangmah a lo hringtu na nu cu lungawi in um seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka fapa, na thinlung taktein i ngai aw; Ka nundaan hi zohṭhim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hlawhhlangnu cu khur thukpi a si; Nunau uire cu thihnak thang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Fifir bangin mi an bawh ih, Mi tampi an siatsuah ih mi zuangzam ah an canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zoso thinpit le vansaang in a um ṭheu? Zoso a riah a sia ṭheu? Zoso mi thawn a to aw ṭheu? Zoso a phunzai ṭheu? Zoso a thu um loin hma a tuar ṭheu? Zoso mit sen remrem in a um ṭheu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zu a in ringringmi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khuathai sungah senzet le tleuzet in a um ih, In tikah dang sungah naalzet in a lut ding a bangmi zu kha zoh hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A netnak ahcun rul bangin mi a cuk ih, Tursia nei rulha bangin mi a cuk ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na mit in thil phundang na hmu ding ih, ṭhatein khua na ruat thei lo ding ih fiangtein na ṭong thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cutik ahcun tipithuanthum laifang ih a itmi pa bangtuk le, Lawng puanzarnak ṭhuam zim ih a itmi pa bangtuk na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />In thawi naón a na lo, In vua naón ka thei lo, Ziangtikah ka tho ding ih, A dang in ding ka hawl hrih ding, tiah na ti ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl kha va daw hlah; Anmah thawn pawl aw hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Annih pawl cu mi siatsuahnak ding thu lawnglawng an ruat ih, Mi siatsuahnak ding thu lawnglawng an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inn cu fimnak in sak a si ih, Theihnak in hngehter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Theihnak in inn khaan hmuahhmuah cu, a sunglawimi le a mawimi thilri in a thuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cah hnakin fim a ṭha sawn, Cah hnakin theihnak a thupi sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ral na do hlanah ralring zetin timtuahnak nei aw; Ruahnak ṭha petu tam na neih tik poh ah ral na nehnak ding a tam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Fimnak cu mi aa hrang ahcun a saang tukih a thei thei lo; Thil thupi rel tikah zianghman sim ding a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo tuah ding lawnglawng khua a khangtu cu, A hmin ah “Harnak Tuahtu,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi aa ih tumtahmi pohpoh cu sualnak a si; Mi hmuhsuam a hmangtu cu zokhal in an hua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Harnak caan ah na bei a dongmai a si ahcun, Misantlai lo taktak na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thah dingih an hruaimi na hmuh ahcun zamrang in va run aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himi cu ka hnaṭuan a si lo tiin um men hlah; Ziangahtile Pathian in a thu cu a thei ih na thinlung a zoh a si. A lo thlingthla ringring ih, na tuahmi vekin a lo sam leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka fapa, khuaitizu kha ei aw, a thaw a si; A thlar sungin a tlami khuaitizu cu a thlum bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fimnak cu na nunnak hrangah a ṭhami a si; Fimnak na neih asile na hmailam a tleu ding ih, na ruahsannak a hlo lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi ṭha pa a bawh ih a inn siatbal ding a tumtu, Mi helhhlong pa vekin va nung hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ziangruangah tile miding cu voi sarih tiang tlu hmansehla, a tho sal ding; Sikhalsehla mi ṭha lo cu vansiatnak in a siatsuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na ral kha vansiatnak a ton tikah na lung awi hlah; A rilhbah tikah na di riam hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na lung a awi asile Bawipa in a lo hmu ding ih a lung a awi lo ding; Cutikah hrem loin a thlah sal pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl ruangah thin nuam loin um hlah; Mi ṭha lo pawl cu va daw hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ziangahtile mi ṭha lo in ruahsan ding a nei lo; Mi ṭha lo ih mei-inn cu a mit ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka fapa, Bawipa le siangpahrang kha upat in ṭihzah aw; Anmah a dodaltu pawl va kom hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ziangahtile an hnenah harsatnak hmakhatte ah a ra thleng thei; Bawipa le siangpahrang hnen in ziangvek siatsuahnak a ra ding ti zo in a thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himi pawl khal hi mifim pawl ih simmi thu an si: Thuṭhen tikih mi ṭanbul neih cu a ṭha lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo kha miding a si, a titu thuṭhentu bawi cu, mi in an camsiat ding ih miphun tinkim in an hua ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sikhalsehla misual a hremtu cu a ṭhangso ding ih, mi upatnak a co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Felte ih thuleh cu rualpi taktak sinak langtertu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lo le ram ṭhatein na neih hnuah le, Pumcawmnak ding na hram a hnget hnu lawngah inn sak aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuhla fiangtein thei loin mi sual va puh hlah; Midang in an ruahsualnak ding thu tla va sim hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka parih a tuah vekin a parah ka tuah ve ding; A tuahmi vekin ka lehrul ding, tiah ti hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi aa zaangzel pa ih lo le sabit hmuan sungin ka feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zohhnik, hlingbur in a khat ih leilung cu hrampi in a khuh ṭheh; Cun a kulhnak lungto phardawl khal a cim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ṭhatein ka zoh ih khua ka ruah tikah, hiti in fimzirhnak ka ngah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Malte in ka zauta hrih pei, Malte in ka it ta hrih pei, Malte in ka cawlta hrih pei, na ti sung ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Farahnak cu rukru bangtuk in le, tlaksamnak cu hriamnam thawn mi a siimtu rukru bangin a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tanglamih thu pawl khal hi Solomon ih thufim an si ih, Judah siangpahrang Hezekiah ih milai pawl in an ngan sinmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ih sunlawinak cu thil a thuh hi a si; Sikhalsehla siangpahrang pawl ih sunlawinak cu thil an phuan hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siangpahrang in ziang a ruat ti cu kan thei thei lo; A saangzetmi van le a thukzetmi tipithuanthum bangtuk in, kan theih ban lomi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngun khi a eek thianter awla, sosu thiam in thil mawizetah a ser ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siangpahrang hnenih ruahnak ṭha lo a petu kha dawi hlo uhla, A uknak cu dingthluk lairelnak thawn a hnget ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrang hmaiah upat va cuh hlah, Mi upa pawl ih umnak hmun khal ah va ding hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziangahtile hitawk ah hung to aw ti cu, Nangmah hnakin a upa sawnmi tonak kian aw ti hnakin a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil na hmuh mi kha zamrang tukin thuṭhennak zungah va sim hlah; Ziangahtile tetti dangin na palhnak a langter sal asile ziangso na tuah ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na innhnen thawn nan ruahnak a bang aw thei lo asile nanmahte in remnak tuah uh; Cule nan thuthup kha va phuang hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na phuang pang asile mi in thu na thuh thei lo kha an thei dingih, na ningzahnak a cem dah nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A caan a si laite ih ṭongmi ṭongkam cu, Ngun kheng sungih sui thingrah bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mifimzet nunsimtu ih simmi thu cu a ngai duhtu hrangah, Sui zunghruk le sui hlawnthil bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Palai fel cu a thlahtu hrangah thinlung daitertu a si; Rawl lak caan ni ling laifangih rialti bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil ka lo pe ding tiah thu mi a kam ih a pe dah lotu cu, Ruah tel lo khawdur le tidai keng lo thli bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thinsaunak thawn uktu bawi hman kha lem a theih; Awkaa nem in thinlung hak hman a nemter thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na ṭulzat hnak in tam deuh khuaitizu ei hlah; Tamtuk na ei asile na luak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na innhnen kha leng tamtuk hlah, Na len tamtuk asile a lo ning ding ih a lo hua ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A dik lo in mi sualpuhnak cu, Mi a that theimi talhtum, ralnam le conkiang vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Harnak caan ah rinsan tlak lomi rinsan cu, Ha hnin thawn rawl khai le ke-awl thawn feh bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Riahsia thinhar mi hnenih hla va sak cu, Khawsik ni ih puanhlum phoih le, Hma parih cite phulh bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na ral a ril a rawng asile ei ding rawl pe aw; A ti a haal asile in ding tidai pe aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutiih na tuah asile a luthlung ah meiling na ret a si ding. Bawipa in ṭhatman a lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saklam thli in ruah a ratpi bangtuk in, Mi relsiatnak in thinhennak a suahpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A phunzai ringring mi nupi thawn innpi sungih umtlang hnakin, Inn luanglu kelkawmte ih um a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ram hlatpi ihsin thuthang ṭha theih cu, Dangcaar tihal laifangih tidai daite in bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Miding in mi ṭha lo pa nehnak a coter a si ahcun, Thihsii rawi mi tikhur, a si lole cerhti baal vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khuaitizu tamtuk ei cu a ṭha lo; Cuvekin mi hnen ihsin thangṭhatnak tamtuk ngah tum cu a ṭha lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mah ih thinhengnak a sup thei lotu cu, Khawkulhnak hauhruang a cim ih a siatmi khua bangtuk a si. Olte in ral an lut ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thangṭhat upatnak cu mi aa hrang ah a kaih lo; Khawṭhal caanih vur tla bangtuk le rawl lak caanih ruah sur bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tican nei lomi camsiatnak cu, Sunṭam le vanva zuang bangin umhmun an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Funghreu cu rang vuaknak ah, Rang kakharh cu laak kakharhnak ah, Fungfek cu mi aa vuaknak ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi aa kha mi aa biak in bia hlah, A lo biak daan vekin na biak ve asile amah thawn nan bang aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi aa kha amah thawn kaih aw in bia aw; Cutiin na ti lo asile ka fim tiah a ruat sual aw pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi aa kha palai ih a thlahtu cu, Amah le amah ke tan aw vek a si; harnak a tong ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thufim cu mi aa pawl ih kaa ahcun, A thlai-aw menmen mi ke-awl pa ih ke bangtuk a si; Zianghman ṭhathnemnak a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi aa upatnak pek cu saili ah saihlum ṭawn cih bangtuk a si. ṭhathnemnak a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi aa ih thufim ṭongṭhimnak hman cu, Zuri pa in a kut a suntu hling a coih tum vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnaṭuan petu bawi in a tawivak mi zuri le mi aa a tonmi poh hnaṭuan a pek ahcun, Li le thal thawn mi a tuahmawh rero mi a bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A aatnak langter sal rerotu mi aa cu, Mah ih luak ei saaltu uico bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mah le mah ka fim tiih a ruat awtu hnakin, Mi aa bik hrangah ruahsannak a um sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi zaangzel ziangah inn lengah a suak duh lo? Ziang so a ṭih? Kiosa maw a ṭih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi zaangzel cu sangka khar a kopza ih a mer awk rero bangin, A ihkhun parah a let aw rero men.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihrek khat cu an zaangzel tuk ih, An kaa sungih rawl san hman an zuam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi zaangzel cu fimkhur zet in thu a let theimi mifim pasarih hnakin, amah ih ruahnak ahcun a fim sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mah thawn a pehpar aw lomi tawhawknak ih a teltu cu, Amahte a fehtu uico ih hnakawr kaitu bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi a bum ih, “Ka lo capoh men,” a titu cu, Mei-alh tom le conkiang hriamnam thawn mi a tuahmawhtu mi molh bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zanthing a um lo a si le meisa a mit; A thupte in mi relsiat hmangtu a um lo le tawhawknak a dai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meihol in meiling a vaamter ih Thing in meisa a alhter bangtuk in, Mi tawh a hmangtu pawl in tawhawknak an suahpi ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi a relsiatu ih ṭongkam cu rawlthaw bangtuk a si; Pum sung tiangin a lut vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Awkaa thlum a nei naón thinlung ṭha lomi cu, Mawizet ih hnihmi leibeel bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi huatnak a neitu cun awkaa ṭha in mi a bia ṭheu; Sikhalsehla a thinlung cu mi bumnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi zaangfah zet bangin a ṭongtu khi va zum hlah; Ziangruangah tile a thinlung cu fihnungza thil in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thinlung sungih a ummi huatnak cu bumnak in a khuh khalle, A ṭhat lonak cu mizapi in an hmu thotho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Midang tlaknak dingah khur a laitu cu cuih khurah amah a tla ding; Midang nennak dingah lung a hriltu cu cuih lungin amah a nen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuphan sim a hmangmi lei in bumnak a tuartu kha a hua; A hrokhrawl mi kaa in siatsuahnak lawng a suahpi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thaizing thu-ah tluang khawng hlah, Cuih ni in ziang a suahpi ding ti na thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ziangtik khalah nangmah le nangmah lawm aw hlah; Midang a si lole mikhual in lo lawm sawn hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungto le vunnel ih khingrih daan hi, Aat ruangih tonmi harsatnak thawn ṭhim ahcun, Zianghman ti tham a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thinheng cu a siakha zet ih mi a siatsuah thei; Asinain iksiiknak thawn ṭhim ahcun, zianghman ti tham a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangah i poisa lo tiih a lo ruah ding hnak cun, Mi pakhat hmaiton ih a sualmawh- nak va remsak khi a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rualpi ṭha cu na thin a lo natter hmanah duhsaknak ṭha a nei; Sikhalsehla na ral in na liangih a lo kuah asile ralring aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pum a puar tik ahcun khuaitizu hman na duh lo ding naón, Na rilrawn laifang ahcun a khazetmi rawl hman khi thlum na ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mah ih innsang ihsin vakvaitu cu, Bu a hluum lomi vate bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rimhmui le sathau rimthaw cun na thin a lo nuamter naón, Thinharnak cun na hnangamnak a balsiat thluh ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na rualpi ṭha siseh, na nu le na pa ih rualpi ṭha siseh, va hngilh hlah; Harsatnak na ton tikah na unau va sim hlah; Khawhlatpi ih a um na unau hnakin na kiang naite ih a ummi, Na innhnen in a lo bawm thei sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka fapa, fimvar tein um awla ka lung a awi ding; I soiseltu pawl kha ṭongkam ka let thei hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi fimvar cun harsatnak a rami an hmu ih an kian thei; Ziang a ruat cuca lo pawl cun harsatnak an pan ih neh hnuah an siir aw sal ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theih dah lomi pa ih leiba hrangah aamahkhan tuah ngamtu cu, A neihmi thil kha aamahkhannak ah lak sak thluh ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zingpit ah a it laimi na rualpi ṭha ring zetih na biak ahcun, Na camriam thawn a bangrep a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cat loin a phunzai mi nupi cu, Nikhawceen ih ruahti for rero thawn an bang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cu nu cu ziangtinso daitein na umter thei ding? Thlihrang teh na kham thei dah maw? Culole na kutzaphak in siti teh na huum thei dah maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thir le thir an tat-awk bangin, Milai khal pakhat le pakhat hnen in fimnak an zir a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Theikung khi ṭhatein na tuamhlawm ahcun theirah ei ding na nei ding; Mah ih bawipa a zohṭhatu hnen-um cu upat an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tidai sungih na hmel na hmuh bangin, Na sinak khal na thinlung sungah na hmu ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Milai ih duhhiarnak hi mithi khua vek a si; A khat zo ti a um dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sui le ngun khi meisa in an hniksak thei; Milai ih ziaza khal porhnak in hniksak a theih ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi aa pa khi thizikte in thawi khal awla, A aatnak cu na thawi tlan thei cuang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na tuuruun kha ṭhatein tuamhlawm awla, Na cawrual pawl kha ralring theitawp in zoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziangahtile lennak hi kumkhua in a hmun lo; Siangpahrang lukhuh hman kumkhua an hmun ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tlanghrap ah rawlko na lak thluh ih, Hrampi na thlawh lai ah rawlko neta pawl an kho lai rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na tuu pawl ih hmul in hnipuan na tak thei ih, Na me hrekkhat na zuar man in loram na lei thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A taanglai mi na me pawl in na innsang le, Na hnen-um nunau pawl ih in dingah mehnawi an lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo cu zohman ih dawi loin anmahte an tlan; Sikhalsehla midingfel cu kiosa vekin an ral a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ram pakhat a sual tikah uktu pakhat hnu pakhat an thleng aw vivo; Sikhalsehla ram pakhatkhat in mifim le thuruatthiam hruaitu a neih ahcun cuih ram cu a cak ih reipi a hmun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi farah pawl a hrem ih harsatnak a petu ram uktu cu, Lo rawl a siatsuahtu ruah takzet thawn an bang aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Daan ziangsiar loih na um ahcun mi ṭha lo lam ṭang na si; Asinain daan na thlun ahcun mi ṭha lo pawl dodaltu na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi sualral pawl cun thudik hi ziangvek a si ti an thei lo; Asinain Bawipa a biatu pawl cun fiangtein an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thinlung tluangtlam loih milian si hnakin, Tluangtlam zetih mifarah si a ṭha sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Daan a thlunmi tlangvalpa cu mi fimvar a si; Mi-hrong a va komtu cu a pa ih mithmai baaltertu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Midang hnen ihsin tangka ṭhang le a miat in milian na si ahcun, Na lennak cu mifarah pawl a zaang- fahtu hnen a thleng leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Daan na thlun lo asile na thlacamnak cu Pathian thinhengtertu sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tluangtlam pakhat khi nungsual dingih na bum a si ahcun, Nangmah le nangmah cuih sualnak ah cun na awk aw ding. Zianghman sualnak a nei lomi cu laksawng ṭha an co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Milian pawl in anmah le anmah khi mifimzet ah an ruat aw ṭheu; Asinain mi ih thinlung a theitu mifarah pakhat khi a fim sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi ṭha pakhat uktu bawi a hung si tikah mi tampi an lung a awi; Asinain mi ṭha lo uktu ih an can tikah misenpi cu an relh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na sualnak thuh na tum ahcun na hlawhtling dah lo ding; Na sualnak cu phuang in hlonhlo aw, Pathian in a lo zaangfah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa cu kumkhua in ṭihzah awla na thin a nuam ding; Na lung a ruh ahcun na nunnak a siatral ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi uk ṭha lo pawl ih hnuai ah farah pawl cu ṭantu an nei lo; Cuih mi uktu cu kiosa huuk rero le vom heer vak rero vekin ṭih a nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thinlung ruahnak nei cuca lomi uktu cu uktu ṭha lozet a si; Ding lonak a huatu cun caan reipi ram a uk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Laithattu cu amah ih thlankhur zamrang zetih a lai rerotu a si. Kham ding a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlaitluang awla na him ding, Na lungput a tluan lo ahcun rinlopi ah khur sungah na tla ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lothlo milaw zet cun ei ding tampi a nei; Tikcu caan a lak ih a cemraltertu cu kumkhua in a farah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rintlak mifel cun a nuam le a famkim mi nunnak a nei; Asinain zamrangih len a duh ahcun hremnak a tuar ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi thleidan neih cu a ṭha lo; Sikhalsehla thuṭhentu hrekkhat cun nawhthuh fate meen duh ah thu an rel sual ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi duhham pawl in zamrangih len an duh tuk ruangah, Farahnak an hnenah a thleng zik ti khi an thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi pakhat ih mawhnak va rem sak awla, Neh hnuah cun na porh rero hnakin a lung a awi sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nu le pa ih thilri ruk in ‘Sual a si lo’ tiih a ruattu cu rukru thawn an dang aw lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Duhhamnak cun harsatnak a suahter; Bawipa rinsan awla na hlawk sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mah ruahnak lawngih ṭan cu aat-hna a si; Na hnakih a fimdeuhmi pawl ih zirhnak khi thlun awla na him ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi farah pawl khi thil va ṭhen awla na hlawhsam dah lo ding; Mi farah pawl na dungtun ahcun mitampi in an lo cam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl bawi an can tikah mipi cu an relh thluh; Sikhalsehla mi ṭha lo pawl an nau tik ahcun miding pawl in ram an uk sal ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na nuncan an lo remtinte na lung a hak asile, Ni khatkhat ah thosal thei nawn loin na siatralta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uktu mi ṭha an si ahcun ram sung mi an nun a nuam; Asinain uktu mi ṭha lo an si ahcun an ram mi pawl an zonzai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fimnak duhtu fapa cun a pa ih lung a awiter. Hlawhhlangnu hnenih paisa hmang raltu cu mi aa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang in dingnak thawn ram a uk asile an ram a hngetkhoh; Asinain sumsaw lawng a ruat asile a ukmi ram a siatral ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na innhnen pawl a hleifuan ih na porh asile, Na hrangah thang na kam thawn a bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midik mitluangtlam pawl an lungawi thawsuak ih an um laiah, Mi ṭha lo pawl cu an sualnak thang ah an awk aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi ṭha in mi farah pawl ih sinak an theih sak; Asinain mi ṭha lo pawl cun cuvek an theih sak thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Midang zawn a ruat lotu cun khawpi buainak an thlenter; Mifim pawl cun thubuai an daiter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mifim in mi-aa taza a cuai tikah, Mi-aa pa cun a hnihsan ih napi in a camriam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi thisen suah a poisa lo mi cun, Miding mi ṭha pohpoh khi a hua; Asinain mi tluangtlam cun miding ih nunnak a hum sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi-aa pawl cun an thinhennak khi hmakhatte-ah an langter; Asinain ruahnak a neimi pawl cu an thin a sau ih an sup aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram uktu in a dik lomi thuthang a zum asile, A hnaṭuan upa pawl hmuahhmuah cu thuphanper an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi farah siseh, mi farah hremtu siseh, Thil bangrep ih an neihmi a um; Bawipa in khawhmuhnak mit a pek veve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa in mi farah pawl ih covo a hum sak ahcun, Reipi ram sungmi a uk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nauhak hrangah cun nuncan rem le daan ṭha thlunter hi thil ṭha a si; Nauhak pakhat amah ih thuthu ih a nun ahcun a nu ningzaktertu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi ṭha lo pawl an lal tikah sualnak a karh zai; Asinain miding pawl in cuih mi ṭha lo pawl an nau vivo kha an hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na fapa kha daan ṭha thlunnak ah nunsim awla, Amah ih ruangah na hmai a hngal ringring ding; Anih cun ziangtik khalah na ningzahnak a suahter lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian ih hmuhsaknak a um lo ahcun, Mipi cu an vaivuan ṭheh. Pathian ih daan a thluntu cu mi lungawi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hnen-um pakhatkhat, hmurka ih va biak men cun a nuncan na rem thei lo ding; Na sim duhmi cu a thei ding naón na thu cu zianghman a siar lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ruat hmaisa loih a ṭongtu hnakin, Ruat ciamciamih a ṭongtu mi-aa hrangah ruahsannak a tam sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na hnen-um ih duhmi hmuahhmuah khi a seenlai ihsin na rak pek ringring a si ahcun, Nikhat khat na neihmi hmuahhmuah a lo lak sak thluh leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thinbahlak pawl cun tawhawknak le buainak tampi an suahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Puarthau hngalhngawnnak hin siatralnak ah a lo thlenter ding; Asinain tangdorte ih na um ahcun mi ih upat na co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Fifir ih rualpi cu a hrangah ral ṭihnung bik a si; Thuṭhennak zungah thudik a sim asile hremnak a tuar ding; Thudik a sim lo asile Pathian in a camsiat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Midang ih an lo ruahdan poisa tukih um khi ṭihnungza a si; Asinain Bawipa na rinsan ahcun phan ding a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi hmuahhmuah in anmah uktu bawi ih mithmai ṭha co cu an duh thluh; Asinain Bawipa ih hnen lawnglawng in a dingmi thuṭhennak cu na co ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi ṭha in mi ṭha lo an hua; Mi ṭha lo in mi ṭha an hua ve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi pawl hi Jakeh fapa Agur ih ṭongmi an si: “Maw Pathian, ka thinlung a bang, Ka thazaang khal a bang thluh zo; Zianghman ka tuah thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei cu ramsa vek ka si thlang, minung ka bang nawn lo. Milai thinlung khal ka nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fimthiamnak khal ka zir dah lo, Pathian thu khal zianghman ka thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zoso vancung thuhla hi a thei thluhtu? Zoso a kut in thli a kai theitu? Asilole zoso puansia in tidai a fun theitu? Asilole zoso lei le van ih ramri a ṭhen theitu? Cupa cu zoso a si, na thei maw? A fapa teh zo a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Pathian ih ṭongkam pohpoh cu a dik a si; Amah cu humhimnak a hawltu hrangah ralphaw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian ih ṭongkam cu beet hlah, A lo kawk ding ih na thuphanpernak kha a langter ding.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Maw Pathian, na hnenah thil pahnih ka lo dil; Ka thih hlanah i coter hram aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuphanpertu si lo dingin i kil aw; Farah tuk le lian tuk khal in i tuah hlah awla, Ka khop tawkfang lawng rawl i pe hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil tampi ka neih ahcun ‘ Bawipa ka ṭul lo,’ ka ti pang ding; Ka farah tuk ahcun ruk ka ru pang ding ih, Ka Pathian hmin ka thangsiatter pang ding.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangtik hmanah hnen-um khi a bawipa ih hmaiah va soisel hlah; Na soisel asile hnen-um in a lo camriam ding ih mual na pho sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pale pawl a camsiat ih, Nule pawl lungtong lotu an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Borhhlawh zet cingin mah le mah Ka thianghlimzet tiih a ruat awtu an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi ṭhazet ka si tiih a ruat awmi an um; Anmah le an mah cu mi ṭha bikah an ruat aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi farah le nunhar pawl nekrawk le dekcok ih a nungmi an um; Cutiin an pum an cawm aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cangvat in fanu pahnih a nei ih an hminah, “I pe aw, I pe aw,” ti an si. Khop ti a nei dah lomi thil pathum an um; “A tawk zo” a ti dah lotu thil pali an um a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cu pawl cu mithi khua Sheol, fa nei lo nucing, Ruahti a haal zetmi ramcaar le mih thei lomi meihlio tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zokhal a pa kha hnihsuak ih a saitu le, A nu a tar tikih a hmuhsuamtu cu, Langta in a sa a ei dingih tlangak in a mit a phorh sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hrangah mangbangza thu thuk pathum an um; Ka theih thei lomi thil pali an um a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cupawl cu vanih a zam reromi muvanlai ih zin, Lungpi parih a vakmi rul ih zin, Tifinriat tlunih tangphawlawng fehnak zin le Mipa in nunau a duhnak zin, tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nupi zuangzam ih cangvaih daan cu hivek in a si: A uire ih ti a bual awk thluh hnuah cun, “Zianghman sualnak ka tuah ual lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leilung ih a tuar thei lomi thil phunthum an um; A zawi thei lomi thil pali an um a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cumi pawl cu Siangpahrang ah a hung cangmi sal, Rawl duhduh ei ding a neimi mi aa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi mitkemzet a sinan pasal a nei thei thothotu nunau le A bawinu ih to-nak a longtu hnen-um nu, tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leilung tlunah a fatezet naón a fimzetmi ramsa pali an um:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cu pawl cu an tha a cak lo naón ṭhal caanah rawl a seekkhawl ciatu sihte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A cak lo naón lungkhaam lakah kua a tuahtu meingan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siangpahrang an nei lo naón, A rual a rual ih a ṭhawn dutdomi kharbok;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na kut khalah na huum thei ih, Siangpahrang innsung khal ah na hmuh theimi dekder, tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An vah laifangih zohthanung thil pathum an um; Ropizet ih feh a hmangmi thil pali an um a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cupawl cu ramsa lakih a cakbik le Zianghman ṭih a nei lomi kiosa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mecang, arcang puar le, A kuthnuai pawl hmaiih a feh hngualhngotu siangpahrang, tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aatthlakza in na puarthau ih, Thil ṭha lo tuah na tum ahcun, Cawl awla ruat ṭhata aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cawhnawi na cawh ciamco le thawphat na ngah, Mi pakhat ih hnar na vuak le thi a suak, Na thin na soter le thubuai harsatnak na tong.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi pawl hi Siangpahrang Lemuel hnenah a nu ih cahmi thufim pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang cu ka duhdawt zetmi ka fapa, ka thlacam ruangih ngahmi fapa, ka rilrah na si. Ziangthu so ka lo sim ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tisa hiarnak le nunau lamah na thazaang le na sumsaw hmang hlah; Siangpahrang tampi a siatsuahtu cu cupawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I ngai hnik, Lemuel. Siangpahrang in zu in ding a si lo; Zu hiarnak neih ding khal a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziangahtile zu an in tikah daan kha an hngilh ih, Mi nunhar pawl covo khal an thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zu cu mithi zik pawl le thinnuam lo beidong pawl hrangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cu pawl cun in hai sehla an lung nomlonak le, An farahnak tla hngilh hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Mahte a sim thei lomi pawl hrangah simsak aw; Bawmtu nei lo pawl ih covo kha hum sak aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hrangah simsak awla, thuṭhentu dik va si aw; Mi farah le mi nunhar pawl ih covo kha hum sak aw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nupi ṭhaṭhum khi ziangtluk in ngah a har! Ruby lungvar mankhung hnakin man a nei deuh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pasal in a rinsanzet ih ziangtik khalah a pasal cu a zonzai lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nunsung hmuahhmuah a pasal parah thil ṭha a tuah ringring ih siatnak a tuah dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Umlak ti nei loin tuuhmul le patzai puan a tak ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sumsaw let pawl ih tangphawlawng bangin, Ram kelet ihsin a innsang hrangah rawl a rak phur ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A innsang hrang rawl zaal dingah le a hnen-um pawl an hnaṭuan ding tawlrel sak dingah, Zingthlapit in a tho ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leiram a hawl ih a lei, A hlawhmi sumsaw in sabit hmuan a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hnaṭuan taima zet a si ih, A thazaang a cak ih a law fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah ih man neihzia a thei ih, Zan siimpi tiang innsang hna a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amahte pat a hmuih ih amah ih hnipuan khal a tak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi farah le mi nunhar hnenah a tirh a siangzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An sungte in kawr hlum an nei thluh ih, Thlatang khawsik caan a thlen khal ah an thla a phang hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tangphah khuh a tah ih sendup mawizetih tahmi hnipuan a hruh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pasal cu khawsungah mizapi ih theihmi hotu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hnipuan le taikhap pawl a tuah ih sumsaw let pawl a zorh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thazaang a cak, an upat zet ih hmailam hrangah thinphannak a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Fimkhur zet le awkaa nemtein a ṭong ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Umlak ti nei loin a innsang ih poihai a tawlrel ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A faale pawl in an thangṭhat ih, A pasal khal in a lawmzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A pasal in, “Nunau tampi cu nupi ṭha an si cio naón, Nang hi a ṭha hleice na si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Iang neih cu mi a buum thei ih mawinak khal a ziam thei; Asinain Bawipa a ṭihzahtu minu cu lom le porh tlak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A tuahmi thil hmuahhmuah ruangah amah cu thang ṭhat uh; Mi hmuahhmuah ih upat tlak minu a si.
  </para>
</usx>
